<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Benamanga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Njowo ngita isimbilwe na Luka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luka</para>
  <para style="mt2">Njowo ngita isimbilwe</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luka</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolo</para>
  <para style="ip">Njowo Nofu ngita isimbilwe na Luka ndi kiganulo ndi kimwi pagati lya figanulo vitai fya Agano imiya, fyevihumulila maisa ga Yesu Kilisto. Kila kimwi kikemelwa “Injili” Mana lyake (njowo nofu). Figanulo ifi fisimbilwe na Matayo na Maliko na Luka na Yohani badala lya kufuwa kwa Yesu. Luka seagasimbile hela makani gya maisa ga Yesu, ila asimbile makani gyevagitile vachulila va Yesu kuhuma peafuwe na kuchulubuka kwa Yesu. Mukiganulo kyekikemelwa Magito gya vanjagila, kwehela munu yoyonda yeichela undakyene panili kiganulo iki kisimbilwe awu kisimbilwe kwiya. Ila vevimbile volofu vakapatine kuva iwesekana kisimbilwe mwaka va Sabini kuhuma peababilwe Yesu Kilisito. Yeasimbile akali Luka yeakali mlami. Usimbo vake na uhumulilo vake iwonesa kuva akali munu yeaimbile. Luka akelile kuhumulila kwa undakyane makani gene gegahumie ga maisa ga Yesu kwa ngita pegahumie neke vangi vavese kuchela unofu makani ga Yesu pevikwimba Luka 1.1-3. Luka seakali Muyawudi Wakolosai 4.10-14 na asimbile kwa ng'asi ambayo vanu vala se Vayawudi vangechela unofu. Lukani ulu likwiwonesa pelu namuna fila peahumulile desituli cha Kiyawudi Luka 1.8.</para>
  <para style="ip">Njowo Nofu ngita isimbilwe na Luka ndi kiganulo kyekiwana na kiganulo cha Matayo na Maliko kwa fila figanulo ifi uhumulila makani galagala kangi kwakuwana. Pagati lya figanulo ifi fidatu, kiganulo kya Luka ndakyene kihumulila makani ga kubabwa kwa Yohani Mbatisa. Luka ikang'ie ihumulila kangi makani gya kuhechelwa sambi, 3.3, 11.4, 17.3-4, 23.34 24.47 na masuka 3.21, 5.16, 6.12, 11.1-12, 22.32.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegagehe</para>
  <para style="io">Luka ichelesa Njowo Nofu na kuhumulila kwa liki asimbile kiganulo ikyo, musula lya 1.1-4.</para>
  <para style="io">Baho ehumulila makani ga kubabwa kwa Yesu na namuna peayiandalise kugita kasi lyake baha kuinyi, musula lya 1.5—4.13.</para>
  <para style="io">Luka ihumumulila kasi che agitile Yesu haswa umanyitu gyegagitilwe na Yesu na makani geawulaniche, musula 4.14—21.38.</para>
  <para style="io">Luka imalila kwa kulonga makani ga kufuwa kwa Yesu peasililwe na kuchulubuka, musula ya 22-24.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Mkomi Tewofili.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:1">Vanu volofu vakavangile kuisimba ngita vavesile makani gala gyegikahumile pagati lya nefwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Vayasimbile makani ago ngita petuhumulilwe na vanu vala vevakali vachiwene makani ago kwa meho gaho kuvangila pamwandi lya kasi lya Yesu. Avo yevalanduche kasi lya Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Veve mkomi Teofili, nene ndiwene ndisake njowo ichi kuhuma pamwandi, ndilolile unofu kukusimbila kwa undakyene njowo chechihumile. <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />Ndigita ndena neke na veve uchele undakyene vonda va njowo cheuwulanichwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubabwa kwa Yohani Mbatisa kulanduchwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Pafigono fila Helode peakali ng'achale va inyi lya Yudea, pakali na mtekechi yumwi, yeakemeliwe Sakalia, yeakali lipinga lya vatekechi va Abiya. Mdala vake akemeliwe Elisabeti nave akali va lukolo va mtekechi Haluni. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Vonda vavili vakali vasanzi pautalo lya Nguluvi, kuno vakolele hilo malagilicho gyonda gya Mtwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Vakali vahela vana, kwakuva Elisabeti akali mgulumbafu, navo vonda vavili vakali vagogolo hilo.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Kigono kimwi, Sakalia akali samu lyake lya kugita kasi lyake lya utekechi mukaye lya Nguluvi, <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />akahaguliwe kwa gudugudu, ngita pevachoviye vatekechi. Ndena Sakalia akaingile mukaye lya Mtwa akatutumiche ubani. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Vakati va kututumicha ubani peufikile, lipinga lya vanu vakali kwivala vakali va kumsuka Nguluvi. <verse eid="LUK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Baho, ndumindumi va kuluhano va Mtwa amuhumile, akahimile palubali lwa ndewo pala pa kindangavala cha maganga pa kututumicha ubani. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Sakalia peamwonile, atinwike na kuogofya. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Ila ndumindumi va kuluhano va Nguluvi akamlongie, “Sakalia bihile kwogofya, kwakuva Nguluvi apulike kusuka kwako. Mdala vako Elisabeti akubabila mwana mkigosi na veve daukumkemela Yohani. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Na yuve wivecha na lukeduko hilo na vanu wolofu vikeduka kubabwa kwa mwene. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Ivecha mkomi pautalo pa Mtwa. Seinyuwa difwayi vala ugimbi. Imemechwa Muhe va Nguluvi akiva mulileme lya maye vake. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Yohani akuvawisa vanu volofu Vaisilaeli vamuwuyile Mtwa Nguluvi vao. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Ilongola pautalo pa Mtwa na ilongochwa na ludali na muhe ngita lya Elia, vadadi akuvakela kangi vana vawo, akuvawuyisa vanu se vasanzi na vawuye mumahocho manofu, ngita vanu vevakumuidikila Nguluvi, akuvagita vanu vayiandalise kumwanuka Mtwa.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Sakalia amwuchile yula ndumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi, “Ndichela wuli kuva lukani hulu ndi lya undakyene? Nene na mdala vangu ndi vagogolo.” <verse eid="LUK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Ndumindumi yula va kuluhano va Nguluvi akamhigile, “Nene ndi Gabilieli, nene nde ndumindumi va Nguluvi, Mwene ndeanilagiche ndilonge na veve ndikulongele njowo ichi nofu. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Seuwesa kuywanga, kwakuva seuidikile aga njowo changu, gegitimila kwa vakati gyake. Sewiwesa kulonga mbaka ago gendikulongie pegihumila.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Vakati ugo, vanu vevakali vakumchindila Sakalia, vakahochile wuli akwikala hilo mukaye lya Nguluvi. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Peahumile kwivala, seavesile kulonga na vala vanu, akalonga navo kwa mawoko, ndeni vakachele kuva akawoniswe kinu na Mtwa mugati lya kaye lya Nguluvi.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Peamalile kasi lyake mu kaye lya Nguluvi, Sakalia akawuyile kukaye lyake. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Pambele Elisabeti mdala va Sakaliya akapatile lusololo. Seahegile mukaye lyake kwa mihechi gihanu. <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />Akalonga, “Endena nde Mtwa anigitile na kuniwonela lusungu, ahechile nyoni lyangu lyakulemuwa kubaba pautalo lya vanu!”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubabwa kwa Yesu kulanduchwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Elisabeti pe akali na lusololo lya mihechi sita, Nguluvi akamlagiliche ndumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi litawa lyake Gabilieli, ahelele ku mwani va Nasaleti inyi lya Galilaya, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />kwa muhinja yumwi yeikemelwa Malia yeahetilwe na Yusufu yeahumile mulukolo lwa Dawudi. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Ndumindumi uyo va kuluhano va Nguluvi akamuhelelie Malia na kumlongela, “Kamwene! Mtwa agehe pamwi na veve na mwene akufunyile!”<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Maliya peapulike njowo icho akatinwike munumbula lyake na akahochile njowo ichi china mana liki? <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Ndumindumi uyo va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi akamlongie, “Malia ubihile kwogofya, Nguluvi kakugavila usanzi. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Wipata lusololo, nave ukumbaba mwana mkigosi na ukumkemela Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Ivecha mkomi na ekemelwa Mwana va Nguluvi yeagehe Kukyanya va finu fyonda. Mtwa Nguluvi daakumgavila kigoda kya ung'achale ngita peakali kuukuu vake Dawudi. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Ivecha ng'achale va vana va Yakobo mbepali na ung'achale vake sewusila ng'odo.” <verse eid="LUK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Malia amuhuchile ndumindumi va kuluhano va Nguluvi, “Nene nde muhinja sendikumchela mgosi. Ivecha wuli luchowo ulu?” <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Ndumindumi va kuluhano kukyanya kwa Nguluvi akamhigile, “Muhe va Nguluvi daukwikila na ludali lwake Nguluvi daukugubika, ndena Mwana yeibabwa daikemelwa Mng'alili, Mwana va Nguluvi. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Uchele kuva lukolo vako Elisabeti apatile lusololo ku ugogolo vake na ugu ndi mwechi gwake gwa sita, mwene yeacheliwe na vanu kuva seivesa kubaba mwana, <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />kwakuva kwihela seliwesekana kwa Nguluvi.” <verse eid="LUK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Malia alongile, “Nene ndi mnyigendwa va Mtwa, ndigitwe ngita ulongile.” Baho ndumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi ahegile.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maliya ekumgendelela Elisabeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Figono fifila, Malia akagitile kisatu kubita ku mwani yeugehe pafidunda fya Yudea. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Ukoya akaingile mukaye lya Sakalia na kumhungila Elisabeti. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Elisabeti peapulike Malia akumhungila, kyali ipindule mulileme lya Elisabeti. Baho ludali cha Muhe va Nguluvi chikamwingile Elisabeti, <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />alongile kwa lichwi likomi, “Ufunyilwe veve kuchumba vadala vonda na mwana yeukumbaba afunyilwe! <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Kwa liki njowo ulu lunihumie nene, hata maye va Mtwa vangu anigendelie nene! <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Pendipulike ukunihungila, kyali kyekikali mulileme lyangu akakeduke na ipindue. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Ufunyilwe veve yeudikile, kuva ivecha ndakyene kyealongile Mtwa.”<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msambo va unjumo va Maliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Malia alongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:46">“Numbula lyangu imnjuma Mtwa,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />Numbula lyangu ekumkedukila Nguluvi yeagehe mkombosi vangu,<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Kwakuva andiwikile nene mnyigendwa vake mdodo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:48">Kuhuma nonde na kuendeleya filelo fyonda vakunikemela nene ndifunyilwe,<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />Kwakuva Nguluvi munya Ngufu andigitie makomi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:49">Litawa lyake ndi ling'alili na seliwananiswa na litawa lingi.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Akuvawonela lusungu vala vevakumwogofya Nguluvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:50">Lusungu lyake ikwikala kilelo mbaka kilelo.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Agitile njowo chikomi kwa liwoko lyake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:51">Kavayaganisa vanu venye kidada mumahocho gya mnumbula chawo.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Avakwisile vang'achale mufigoda fyawo fya ung'achale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:52">Avanamule vala vevakali vadodo.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Venye njala avagwitise kwa finu finofu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:53">Vamosi avadagile mawoko ng'ani.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Kamutanga mchulila vake Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:54">Akiendeleya kuvawika kuvawonela lusungu.<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />Daavawika kuvawonela lusungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:55">Ibulahimu na filelo fyake mbepali.”<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Malia ekalile kwa Elisabeti mihechi gidatu, baho akuwuyile pakaye lyake.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubabwa kwa Yohani Mbatisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Figono fya kubaba kwake Elisabeti pe fifikile, ababile mwana mkigosi. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Vapepi na vakolo vake pevapulike kuva Mtwa amwonie lusungu hilo, navo vakedusile pamwi na mwene.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Mwana pafikile figono finane, vakamdumule bina. Vakasakile kumgavila litawa lya daada vake, yeakemeliwe Sakalia. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Ila maye vake alongile “Ndaa! Litawa lyake ikemelwa Yohani.”<verse eid="LUK 1:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Vakamlongie, “Kwihela munu yeyonda mulukolo lyenu yeakali na litawa ngita ilyo.?” <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Baho vamgitile kimanyilo Sakaliya daada va yula mwana, neke kuchela kuva mwene ekela kumtambucha litawa ani.<verse eid="LUK 1:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Sakalia asukile kibawu kya kusimbilia, asimbile endena, “Litawa ndi Yohani.” Vanu vonda vakadudwive! <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Bahobaho, Sakalia avangile kulonga kangi, akavanga kumfunya Nguluvi. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Vapepi vake vakaogofya na luchowo lila lyalutie kila pono pa fidunda fya inyi lya Yudea. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Kila yumwi yeapulike luchowo lila, akahochile munumbula lyake akwihucha, “Mwana uyo ivecha munu wuli?” Kwakuva ndakyene ludali cha Mtwa chikali pamwi na mwene.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uvichi va Sakalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Sakalia, daada vake Yohani, amemichwe Muhe va Nguluvi, nave akalonga uvichi ugu kuhuma kwa Nguluvi,<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />“Tumnjume Mtwa Nguluvi va Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:68">Kwakuva avaachile vanu vake na kuvawokola.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Atugavile Mkombosi munya ludali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:69">kilelo kya Dawudi mchulila vake.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Ngita alongile kuhuma pamwandi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:70">Kuchumbila vavichi vang'alili,<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />Kuva akutukombola kuhuma kwa vachindwamwa vetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:71">na kuhuma muludali lwa vanu vonda vevikutuvipila.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Alongile akuvawonela lusungu vagogolo vetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:72">na daiwika lyagano lyake ling'alili.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Kilapo kyeamlapie mgogolo vetu Ibulahimu,<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />kutukombola kwa vachindwamwa vetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:74">Atutange tuvese kumgundamikila mwene bila kogofya,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />Neke tugite ngita Nguluvi peikela na vadikiliwa pautalo pa Nguluvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:75">Figono fyonda fya wumi vetu.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Veve mwana vangu wikemelwa mvichi va Nguluvi yeagehe kukyanya lya finu fyonda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:76">Ukumlongolola Mtwa umgololie ng'asi lyake,<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />Kavalongela vanu vake kuva mwikombolewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:77">kwa kuvahechela sambi chawo.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Ukelo va Nguluvi vetu na lusungu vake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:78">Ukutung'alachila ngita lichuwa pelihumila kukyanya,<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />Kwa nefwe twitukala mukisi na vala vevikala munyigi lya kufuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:79">welu ulo ukutulongocha muwumi na mulutengamaso.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Mwana akulile na kwongeseka ludali mumuhe. Ekalile kudasi mbaka kigono kila peibwitukile kwa vanu va Isilaeli.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Kubabwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Matayo 1.18-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Figono fila Agusitini, ng'achale mkomi va Lumi alagiche vanu vonda va ung'achale va Lumi vavalilwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Ilyo nde ikali lya kwanja vanu kuvalilwa, vakati Koneli peakali mkomi va inyi lya Silia. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Vanu vonda vahelelie kuvalilwa, kila munu ku kaye lyake pevababilwe.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Yusufu avangile lugendo kuhuma mwani va Nasaleti weuge inyi lya Galilaya, akahelela mwani va Betelehemu yeugehe inyi Yudea, pono peababilwe ng'achale Dawudi. Yusufu ahelile ukoya kwakuva ahumile mukilelo kya Dawudi. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Ahelelie na Malia kuvalilwa, mdala yeamwehetile, yeakali na lusololo. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Pevali Beselehemu, kigono kyake kyakubaba pekifikile, <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />akababile msongola, akamfwike fisepe. Baho akamvasise mukibudi, mulibani lya kuliya vang'oko, kwakuva sevapatile pono pakuvasa vagenji.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vakwamilaji na Vandumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Muinyi yila kukali na vakwamilaji vevali vikwikala mukitava kyakukwamila, vakidima va vang'oko vawo pamie.<figure style="fig" file="02 Shepherds.jpg" size="col" ref="2.8">Vakwamila vidima vang'oko</figure> <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Ndumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi vakavahumie na Ukomi va Mtwa ukavang'alie palubali ponda, navo vakaogofya hilo. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Ndumindumi uyu va Nguluvi kuluhano akavalongie, “Mbihile kwogofya! Ndivaletie njowo nofu chechikuvakedusa vanu vonda. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Neng'uli kumwani va Dawudi, ababilwe mkombosi venu, mwene ndi Kilisito, Mtwa! <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Ilyi kimanyilo kwa nyenye, mukumulola mwana kyali anyengilwe fisepe na agonichwe mulibani lya kuliya vang'oko.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Bahobaho lipinga likomi lya vadumindumi va Nguluvi kuhuma kuluhano vakatang'ana na ndumindumi uyo va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi. Vakamnjuma Nguluvi vakilonga,<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Ukomi va Nguluvi ugehe kukyanya hilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:14">Lutengamaso kwa vanu vevagehe muinyi yonda vevakeliwe na mwene.”<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Vala vandumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi pevawuyile kuluhano, vakwamilaji valonganile, “Tuhelele ku Betelehemu tukalole kila kyekihumie, kyeatulongie Mtwa.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Baho, vakanyilie, vakamuwene Malia na Yusufu na yula mwana kyali yeanyengilwe kisepe na agonichwe mulibani lya kuliya vang'oko. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Vakwamilaji pevamuwone yula mwana, vakavalongie vasasi njowo cha mwana cheavalongiwe na ndumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Vonda vevapulike njowo icho chevalongilwe na vakwamilaji vakadudwive. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Ila Malia avikile njowo chonda munumbula lyake na kugahocha hilo. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Vala vakwamilaji vawuyile kukitava kya kukwamila, kuno vakimufunya Nguluvi na kumnjuma kwa finu fyonda fyevapulikile na kufiwona, gyonda gakali ngita pevakali valongilwe na ndumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana igavilwa litawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Pefikile figono finane, kigono kya kudumula bina, akemeliwe litawa lyake Yesu. Litawa ilyo agavilwe na ndumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi vakati Malia akali ihela lusololo.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu isindikwa mukaye lya Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Figono pefyafikile fya Yusufu na Malia kung'alichwa ngita pevang'ang'ilwe na Malagicho ga Musa cheagavilwe na Nguluvi. Ndena vakamnyamue mwana, vakahelela nave ku Yelusalemu vakamsindike pautalo lya Mtwa Nguluvi. <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />Ngita isimbwilwe Mumalagilicho lya Mtwa, “Kila msongola ivikwa pang'alili pa Mtwa.” <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Kangi vahelelie neke vaheche usembe, vakaheche ng'unda vavili awu mapwipwi gavili ngita Malagicho gya Mtwa gegilagichwa.<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Chipindi icho ukoya mwani va Yelusalemu pakali na munu yumwi, msanzi na akumsuka Nguluvi, litawa lyake Simioni. Mwene akali ichindila kwa ng'efu ukombosi va Isilaeli na Muhe va Nguluvi akali pamwi nave. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Muhe va Nguluvi akali amulongie kuva seifuwa mbaka amlole Kilisito Mtwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Simioni akiva alongochwe na Muhe va Nguluvi, aheleli pakaya lya Nguluvi. Baho Vasasi va Yesu vakamsindike pakaye pa Nguluvi vamgitile ngita peisakilwe na Malagicho ga Musa. <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simioni akamnyamule Yesu mumiwoko gyake, baho akamfunyile Nguluvi akilonga,<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Nonde Mtwa umleke mchulila vako ahelele kwa ulutengamaso. Ngita peulongie<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Kwa meho gangu ndimwene mkombosi vako,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />Kwakuva umuhagule aveche mkombosi va vanu va inyi chonda,<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Uyu welu vakuvagubikila vanu se Vayawudi vamchele Nguluvi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:32">Na kuletela ukomi kwa vanu vako va Isilaeli.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Daada vake na maye vake Yesu vakali vadudwive luchowo lwa mwana gaalongile Simioni. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Simioni avafunyile, akamlongie Malia, maye vake Yesu, “Mwana uyu ahaguliwe na Nguluvi kwa kuyaga na kukomboliwa na kuchulubuchwa kwa vanu volofu kuinyi lya Isilaeli. Mwene ivecha kimanyilo kuhuma kwa Nguluvi dakikanilwa na vanu vonda, <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />na mahocho ga vanu volofu gigubutulwa. Na veve mwene, uvasi weuge ngita lipanga likali livawa numbula lyako.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Kukali na mvichi yumwi mdala, akali mgogolo hilo litawa lyake Ana, muhinja va Fanueli, va likabila lya Asheli. Mdala huyu ekalile na mgosi vake kwa myaka saba kuhuma peatolilwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Baho akali mwigani mbaka vakati akiva mgogolo va myaka semanini na chitai. Vakati ugo gonda akali Mukaye akimgundamikila Nguluvi ngajila kuliya kinu na kusuka palumie na pamunyi. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Saa yiyila, mdala yula ihumiche pautalo pa vanu, akamuhongiche Nguluvi na kuvalongela luchowo lwa mwana kwa vanu vonda vevakali vikuuchindila ukombosi va vanu va ku Yelusalemu.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwuya Nasaleti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Yusufu na Malia pevasindile kugita finu fyonda fyefisakilwe na malagicho gya Mtwa, vawuyile kumwani kwawo Nasaleti ukoya Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Mwana yula akulile, kwongeleka ludali na amemile uginyange na akamemile na usanzi va Nguluvi.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mdimi Yesu Mukaye lya Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Vasasi va Yesu vakali vachovie kuhelela ku Yelusalemu, kila mwaka vakati va lihungu lya Pasaka. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Yesu peakali na myaka kumi na givili, vakahelela pamwi na Yesu ku lihungu lila lya Pasaka ngita pevagitila kila mwaka. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Pevamalile lihungu, Yusufu na Malia vakavangile kuwuya pakaye lyawo, ila mwana vao Yesu asigalie ku Yelusalemu ila vasasi vake sevachele. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Vachelile kuva agehe pamwi na lipinga lya vanyalugendo, vagendile lugendo lwa kigono kyonda, baho vavangile kumsaka pagati lya lukolo na vaganja vawo. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Sevamwonile ndena, vakawuyile ku Yelusalemu neke kumsaka.<verse eid="LUK 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Kigono kya udatu, vamuwene pakaye lya Nguluvi pagati lya vawulanichi Vakiyawudi vakali, akivapulikicha na kuvahucha mahucho. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Vonda vevapulike malichwi gake vakadudwive luhala lwake na mahigo gake gya unginyange. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Vasasi vake pevamuwene vakadudwive. Maye vake, amuhuchile, “Mwana vangu, wuli utugitile endee? Daada vako na nene tukali tukukusaka kwa kusugwima.” <verse eid="LUK 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Yesu akavahigile, “Mukunisakila liki? Semchele kuva nditakilwe kuvecha pakaye lya Daada vangu?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Ila vasasi vake sevachele malichwi geavalongie.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Baho, Yesu pamwi na vasasi vake vakawuya Nasaleti ukoya akali akuvaginya. Na Maye vake akaendelie kuvika njowo icho. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Yesu akaendelie kukula na kuhongeleka uginyange na utali na akaginile kuvecha msanzi kwa Nguluvi na vanu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Yohani Mbatisa akuvadalikila vanu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matayo 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maliko 1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohani 1.19-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Mwaka va ulongu na chihanu va utavala va ng'achale mkomi Tibeliyo, Ponitiyo Pilato akali itavala inyi lwa Yudea. Helode akali mtavala va Galilaya na lukolo vake Filipo akali mtavala va lilungulu lya Ituleya na inyi lya Talakoniti. Lusania akali mtavala va inyi lya Abileni, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />na Anasi na Kayafa vakali vatekechi vakomi va Nguluvi. Figono ifyo luchowo lwa Nguluvi lyamwachie Yohani mwana va Sakalia ukoya kudasi. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Yohani akahelele ku inyi chonda chechigehe mumbali lya mgoka Yolidani. Akavadalikia vanu valeke sambi chawo na vabatiswe neke Nguluvi avahechelele sambi chawo. <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Ngita peyasimbilwe mukiganulo cha mvichi va Nguluvi yeikemelwa Isaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">“Munu yumwi ikemela kuhuma kudasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Mumgalanichile Mtwa ng'asi lyake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">Mugolole ng'asi lyake.<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Kila litava lisilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">Kila lidunda na kidunda fisengamulwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">Kila ng'asi yeigogombie igoloswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">Ng'asi lihofu itengeneswa.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Vanu vonda vakuulola ukombosi yeakuleta Nguluvi.’”<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Baho lipinga lya vanu lyemuhelelie Yohani neke avabatise, Yohani akavalongie “Nyenye filelo fya liyoka! Nde ani avalongie mnyile kuhigwa na Nguluvi? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Mwonese kwa magito kuva muhongiche. Mbihile kwihocha Nguluvi akwivaidikila ngita mukwifuna kuva, ‘Daada vetu ndi Ibulahimu!’ Ndikuvalongela ndakyene, Nguluvi ivesa kugagita maganga aga gaveche vana va Ibulahimu. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Livago lisindilwe kuvikwa mumidadikwa ga mibiki, suwe kila libiki lyeselibaba minunu manono lidumulwa na kutagwa mulyoto.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Lipinga lya vanu likahuchile, “Nondee tugite liki?”<verse eid="LUK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Yohani avahigile, “Munu yeagehe na myenda givili na amugavile yeihela mwenda na yeagehe na kyakulia na agite ndeni.” <verse eid="LUK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Vanyamula usulu navo vakahele neke vabatiswe, vamuhuchile, “Muwulanichi, nefwe tugite liki?”<verse eid="LUK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Avalongie, “Mbihile kunyamula usulu chongofu kuchumba kila kyemlongilwe.”<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Vapuga navo vakamwuchile, “Na nefwe tungite liki?” Akavahigile, “Mbihile kunyaga kinu kya munu vala kumulata munu yeyonda kwa udesi, mugwite na kila kyemuhombwa.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Vanu vakali vilolela kinu kyekihumila, vakali vakwihocha munumbula chawo makani gya Yohani kuva mwene ndi Kilisito yeahaguliwe na Nguluvi. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Baho Yohani avalongie vonda, “Nene ndikuvabatisa kwa malenga, ila ikwacha mwene yeagehe na umwimike kuchumba nene. Nene sendiidikilwa hata kuwopola ndegei cha mikobasi gyake. Uyo akuvabatisa kwa Muhe va Nguluvi na kwa lyoto. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Mwene ana luhelo mumawoko gyake, neke apetele mpunga na kuivika mulusanja lyake na inyanya miyeyela mulyoto weseuchima.”<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Kwa makanyo myongofu chingi Yohani avadalikie vanu Njowo Nofu. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Pambele Yohani amlakie Ng'achale Helode, kwakuva akamnyagile Helodia mdala va lukololo vake na kumgita mdala vake, pamwinga na mawofu gyonda gyeagitile Helode. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Baho, Helode akalutiche uwofu kwa kumvika Yohani mukiwopo.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ebatiswa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Matayo 3.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maliko 1.9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Vanu vonda pevamalilwe kubatiswa na Yesu akabatiswa. Na peakali ekumsuka Nguluvi, luhano chikadindwike, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />na Muhe va Nguluvi akamwikile muuwombo ngita ng'unda. Lichwi yapulikike kuhuma ku luhano: “Veve ndive Mwana vangu ndikukeliye, ndikelilwe na veve.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukolo lwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Matayo 1.1-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Yesu peavangile kasi lyake, akali na myaka selasini na vanu vakahochile mwene nde mwana va Yusufu, Yusufu akali mwana va Heli. <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Heli akali mwana va Masati, yeali mwana va Lawi na mwene akali mwana va Meliki na mwene akali mwana va Yanai na mwene akali mwana va Yusufu, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Yusufu akali mwana va Matatia na mwene akali mwana va Amosi na Amosi akali mwana va Nahumu na Nahumu akali mwana va Esili na Esili akali mwana va Nagai, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Nagai akali mwana va Maati na Maati akali mwana va Matatia na Matatia akali mwana va Semeini na Semeini akali mwana va Yoseki na Yoseki akali mwana va Yoda <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Yoda akali mwana va Yohanani na Yohanani akali mwana va Lesa na Lesa akali mwana va Selubabeli na Selubabeli akali mwana va Setieli na Setieli akali mwana va Neli, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />na Neli akali mwana va Meleki na Meleki akali mwana va Adi na Adi akali mwana va Kosamu na Kosamu akali mwana va Elimadamu na Elimadamu mwana va Eli, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />na Eli akali mwana va Yoshua na Yoshua akali mwana va Eliezeli na Eliezeli akali mwana va Yolimu na Yolimu akali mwana va Matati na Matati akali mwana va Lawi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Lawi akali mwana va Simeoni na Simeoni akali mwana va Yuda na Yuda akali mwana va Yusufu na Yusufu akali mwana va Yonamu na Yonamu akali mwana va Eliakimu, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />na Eliakimu akali mwana va Melea na Melea akali mwana va Mena na Mena akali mwana va Matata na Matata akali mwana va Natani na Natani akali mwana va Dawudi, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Dawudi akali mwana va Yese na Yese akali mwana va Obedi na Obedi akali mwana va Boazi na Boasi akali mwana va Salimoni na Salimoni akali mwana va Nashoni, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Nashoni akali mwana va Aminadabu na Aminadabu akali mwana va Adimini na Adimini akali mwana va Alini na Alini akali mwana va Hesiloni na Hesiloni akali mwana va Pelesi na Pelesi akali mwana va Yuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Yuda akali mwana va Yakobo na Yakobo akali mwana va Isaka na Isaka akali mwana va Ibulahimu na Ibulahimu akali mwana va Tela na Tela akali mwana va Naholi, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Naholi akali mwana va Selugi na Selugi akali mwana va Leu na Leu akali mwana va Pelegi na Pelegi akali mwana va Ebeli na Ebeli akali mwana va Sala, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Sala akali mwana va Kenani na Kenani akali mwana va Alifakasadi na Alifakasadi akali mwana va Shemu na Shemu akali mwana va Nuhu na Nuhu akali mwana va Lameki, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lameki akali mwana va Metusela na Metusela akali mwana va Enoki na Enoki akali mwana va Yaledi na Yaledi akali mwana va Mahalaleli na Mahalaleli akali mwana va Kainani, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Kainani akali mwana va Enoshi na Enoshi akali mwana va Seti na Seti akali mwana va Adamu na Adamu akali mwana va Nguluvi.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Kugechwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Matayo 4.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Maliko 1.12-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yesu peawuyile kuhuma mumgoka Yolidani akiva apatile ludali lwa Muhe va Nguluvi na alongwichwe na Muhe va Nguluvi kudasi. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Ukoya akagechilwe na Setani kwa figono alubaini. Pafigono ifyo, sealiye kinu kyokyonda na pevichumbile figono fila njala ikamvavile.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Baho Setani akamlongie, “Ngita veve ni Mwana va Nguluvi, ulilongele liganga ilyi livecha libumunda.” <verse eid="LUK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yesu amhigile, “Masimbo gya Nguluvi gasimbilwe, ‘Munu sekwikala kwa libumunda hela.’”<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Baho Setani akamlongocha pakidunda kitali, bahobaho akamwonise ung'achale weugehe kuinyi yonda. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Setani akamlongie, “Dandikugavila umwimike na finu fyonda ufitavale na dauvecha mkomi hilo, kwakuva fyonda ndigavilwe nene na nene ndivesa kumgavila munu yeyonda yendimkeliye. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Ifi fyonda fivecha fya veve, ngita ukunifunya.”<verse eid="LUK 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yesu akamhigile, “Masimbo gya Nguluvi gasimbilwe, ‘Mfunye Mtwa Nguluvi vako na kugita njowo chonda na kumfunya Nguluvi weka hela.’”<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Baho Setani akamlongoche mbaka kumwani ku Yelusalemu, akamvikile paneng'eneng'e pa kaye lya Nguluvi. Akamlongie, “Ngita veve ndi Mwana va Nguluvi, witage panyi. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Kwakuva masimbo gya Nguluvi gasimbilwe, ‘Nguluvi ekuvalagicha vandumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi vake vakudime.’ <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Kangi, ‘Vakukunyamula mumawoko gyawo, ubihile kwikwambadula ligulu lyako muliganga.’”<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Ila Yesu akamhigile, “Mumasimbo gya Nguluvi gasimbilwe, ‘Ubihile kumgecha Mtwa Nguluvi vako.’”<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Setani peasindile kumgecha kwa kila njowo, akamlekile ludodo.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ivanga kasi lyake ku Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Matayo 4.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Maliko 1.14-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Baho Yesu awuyile kumwani lya Galilaya akiva na ludali lwa Muhe va Nguluvi na njowo chake chikalutie ku Galilaya na muinyi chonda chechigehe pepi. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Mwene akali akuvawulanicha vanu mukaye lyawo lya kutang'anila Vayawudi na kila yumwi akamnjuma.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ikanwa ku Nasaleti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:53">Matayo 13.53</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maliko 6.1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Baho Yesu akahele ku Nasaleti, pono paaleliwe na kigono kya Kutulula, aingie mukaye lya kutang'anila Vayawudi ngita pevigita kila kigono. Akaimile na imbile Masimbo gya Nguluvi kwa lichwi likomi. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Akagavilwe kiganulo cha mvichi va Nguluvi yeakemeliwe Isaya, akadindue na akawene pono pepasimbilwe,<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />“Muhe va Mtwa agehe mugati lyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">Kwakuva anihague na anibakile mafuta</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">Ndivasindikile vahangala njowo nofu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">Anilagichile ndivadalikile vahopwa vilekelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">Na vabofwike meho vilola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">Na kuvalekela vanu yevigudwa,<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />Na kulanducha kuva chipindi chifikile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:19">cha Mtwa kuvawokola vanu vake.”<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Yesu peasindile kulanducha akakigubika kila kiganulo, akamgavila mnjangila, baho akalile panyi. Vanu vonda vevakali mukaye lya kutang'anila Vayawudi vakafulutule meho. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Mwene avangile kuvalongela, “Lisimbo ilyi lyempulike litimie neng'uli ngita pempulike pelikwimbwa.”<verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Vonda vakamkelile hilo, vakadudwive na njowo chake chechimemile usanzi gealongile. Vakalongile, “Uyu mwana va Yusufu hamu?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yesu akavolongie, “Ndakyene mwivesa kunilongela mufano ulu, ‘Mlami akwinanicha yumwene’ Kangi mwilonga ‘Njowo chonda che tupulike ugitile kula Kapelinaumu, gagite kangi baha ku mwani vako.’” <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Yesu endelie kulonga, “Ndakyene ndikuvalongela, mvichi seichelwa kumwani lyake. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Ila mpulikiche, ndakyene ndikuvalongela kukali na vagane volofu painyi lya Isilaeli vakati va Elia. Vakati hugo ndonya seitonyile myaka midatu na mihechi sita, kukali na lumyayo inyi yonda. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Elia sealagichwe kwa mgane yeyonda yula, ila kwa mgane yumwi yeikalie ku Selefati muinyi lya Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Kangi inyi lya Isilaeli vakati va mvichi Elisha kukali na vakalavilo volofu. Ila kukali kwihela munu yoyonda yeananile ila Namani weka hela munu va inyi lya Siliya.”<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Vanu vonda vevakali pala kaye lya kutang'anila Vayahudi pevapulike ng'ani hicho, vakavipile hilo. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Vakaimile na vakamhechile kwivala pa mwani vawo weukali uchengilwe pakyanya lya kidunda, vakamsindike mbaka pa kineng'eneng'e hilo pa kidunda ikyo neke vamtage mu ligema. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Ila Yesu achumbile pagatigati lyawo, akahelela.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munu munya lihoka lihafu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Maliko 1.21-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Baho Yesu akahele mbaka Kapelinaum mwani va Galilaya na pa Kigono kya Kutulula akavanga kuvawulanicha vanu. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Vakadudwive na mawulanichi gake, kwakuva mawulanichi gake gakali na umwimike. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Mugati mwa kaye lya kutang'anila Vayawudi pakali na munu yeakali na lihoka lihafu, abwatile akilonga, <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />“Vee Yesu va Nasaleti wisaka utugite liki? Wuli wachile kutuhananga? Ndikuchela veve ndi Mng'alili va Nguluvi!”<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yesu akamkemie lihoka lihafu akilonga, “Chike! Mhege munu huyu!” Baho yula lihoka lihafu likamgwisile panyi yula munu pautalo lyavo, akahegile bila kumlemacha.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Vanu vonda vakadudwive vakilonganila, “Ulu luchowo liki? Munu uyu agehe na umwimike na ludali akuvalongela mihoka mihafu vahege, nawo vihuma!” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Ndena njowo cha Yesu chikalutie pa mwani ponda pa Galilaya.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvananicha vanu volofu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matayo 8.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Maliko 1.29-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yesu akahumile mula mu kaye lya kutang'anila Vayawudi, akahelela kukaye kwa Simoni. Koya akamwene mganafu va Simoni, akali itamika evawa ng'ali, navo vakamsukile Yesu amnaniche maye yula. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Yesu akaachile akaimile pepi na yula mtamwa, akailakalila evawa nalyo evawa ikamuhumile. Yula maye bahobaho akaimile na kuvanga kuvagundamikila.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Lichua pelikalidibala, vonda vevali na vatamwa vao vakavasindike kwa Yesu, nave akavavikile miwoko gyake pakyanya lya kila mtamwa, akavananiche vonda. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Mihoka mihafu yakavahumile vanu volofu, vatovile kyoo kuno vilonga, “Veve nde Mwana va Nguluvi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:41">Ila Yesu akavalakie na kuvakanila kulonga, kwakuva vakachele mwene nde Kilisito.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu idalika mu kaye cha kutang'anila Vayawudi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Maliko 1.35-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Mbungamie, Yesu ahegile akahelela pono kwihela vanu. Vanu vakavangile kumsaka na pevamuwonile vanu vakamkanile abihile kuhega. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Ila akavalongie, “Ndena nditakilwa kuvadalikila vanu Njowo Nofu cha Ung'achale va Nguluvi kumwani gingi, kwakuva ikyo ndikyo Nguluvi andilagiche ndigite.” <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Ndena endelie kuvadalikila vanu mukaye lya kutang'anila Vayawudi pa inyi yonda va Yudea.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvakemela vachulila va kwanja</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Matayo 4.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maliko 1.16-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Kigono kimwi, Yesu akali imile mumbali lya lihiva lya Genesaleti, vanu volofu vakali va mchungutile kuno vikwikekeneka neke vaveche kupulika unanzi va Nguluvi. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Akawene wato givili muling'umbing'umbu lya lihiva. Gegilekilwe na valowa somba yevakali visambula nyafu chawo. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Yesu akaingile muwato wumwi lwa Simoni, akamsukile Simoni ahegeleche wato kidodo kuhuma muling'umbung'umbu mulihiva mbaka mumalenga. Baho ekalile panyi, ekuwulanicha lipinga lya vanu akiva muwato.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Peamalile kuwulanicha akamlongie Simoni, “Gube wato mbaka pakilwitu cha malenga, baho ukwise nyafu chako mumalenga ulowe somba.”<verse eid="LUK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simoni akamhigile, “Mtwa, tugitile kasi lya kulowa somba palumie yonda setupatile kinu, ila kwakuva ulongile, nditaga nyafu.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Vakatagile nyafu chawo na vakalovile somba wolofu hata nyafu chawo cha vangile kudumuka. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Vakavapungile mawoko vayawo vevakali muwato wungi vache kuvatanga. Vakaachile na vakamemiche somba wato chonda givili hata chivangile kudibala. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Simoni Peteli peaonile njowo ago gyonda, afugime pautalo pa Yesu kuno elonga, “Hege pautalo lyangu, eve Mtwa, kwakuva nene nde munya sambi!”<verse eid="LUK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Simoni na vayage vonda vakadudwive kwa kulova somba wolofu. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Filafila Yakobo na Yohani, vana va Sebedayo, vakali vakolo valowa somba. Yesu akamlongie Simoni, “Bihile kwogofya! Kuhuma neng'uli na kwendelela uvecha ukuvaleta vanu kwa nene ngita valowa pevileta somba kukaye.”<verse eid="LUK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Vakakwegile wato chawo mbaka muling'umbung'umbu lya lihiva, valekile kila kinu na vakamfuatile Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ekumnanicha munu munya ukalavilo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matayo 8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Maliko 1.40-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Yesu peakali ku mwani wumwi, akaachile munu yumwi munya ukalavilo muvili vonda. Munu yula peamwene Yesu, akajigwise ufuma akamsukile Yesu, “Mtwa, ndichela wiwesa kuninanicha neke nding'ale.”<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yesu akagolue liwoko, akambyalise na kulonga, “Ndisaka! Unane!” Bahobaho wula ukalavilo ukamuhuma. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Yesu akamlagiche, “Ubihile kumlongela munu yoyonda, ila helele kwiwonesa kwa mtekechi, ukaheche usembe kwa kung'alichwa kwa veve ngita pealagiliche Musa, vanu vonda vachele kuva ung'alichwe.”<verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Ila njowo cha Yesu chikaginile kulutala muinyi yonda. Mapinga ga vanu vakafikile kumpulikicha na vakasakile kunanichwa matamwa gyawo. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Ila Yesu akahelelie kudasi na ukoya akamsukile Nguluvi.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ekumunanicha munu munya lugaso</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matayo 9.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maliko 2.1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Kigono kimwi, Yesu akali iwulanicha. Vamonga Vafalisayo na vawulanichi va malagicho yevahumile ku mwani ku Galilaya na Yudea na Yelusalemu vakali vikalile baho. Ludali cha Mtwa chikali pamwinga nave kwa kuvananicha vatamwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Baho vanu vangi vakaachile, vamnyamue munu munyalugaso paulili, vakasakile kumwingicha mugati vamvike pautalo pa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Ila sevakawesile kwingila mugati kwakuva kukali na vanu volofu, baho vakakang'ie pakyaya pa kituvili kuno vamnyamue mtamwa, vakatobuwe kituvili pono pe agehe Yesu, vakamkwisile munu munya lugaso muluhaga, vakamvikile pautalo pa Yesu.<figure style="fig" file="17 Lowering Man Through the Roof.jpg" size="col" ref="5.19">Vanu vatai vakumkwisa munu pakituvili</figure> <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Yesu pealolile mbatwa yawo ngomi, akamlongie yula mtamwa, “Mwato vangu, ulekilwe sambi chako.”<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Vawulanichi va malagicho na Vafalisayo vakavangile kwiwucha. “Uyu nde ani yekumliga Nguluvi? Yeani yeiwesa kuvalekela sambi? Nguluvi yumwene yeiwesa kulekela sambi!” <verse eid="LUK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yesu akachele mahocho gawo, akavahucha, “Mwihocha liki munumbula chenu? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Nde liki lipefu hilo, kulonga, ‘Ulekilwe sambi chako,’ awu kulonga, ‘Wime ugende’? <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Ila ndisaka muchele kuva nene Mwana va Munu ndigehe na umwimike va kuvalekela vanu sambi muinyi.” Baho akamlongie munu munyalugaso, “Wime utegule luhaga lyako na uhelele kukaye.”<verse eid="LUK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Bahobaho yula munu munyalugaso akaemile pautalo lya vonda, akategule luhaga lyake na kuhelela kukaye kuno akumnjuma Nguluvi. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Vanu vonda vakadudwive hilo! Vakakogofya, vamkamnjuma Nguluvi, vakilonga, “Neng'uli tuwonile umanyitu.”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ekumkemela Lawi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matayo 9.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maliko 2.13-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Pambele, Yesu akahumile kwivala, amwonile mnyamula usulu yeakemelilwe Lawi, ekalile mukaye mwa kuhombela usulu. Yesu akamlongie, “Ndifwate!” <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Lawi akahimile akaleka kila kinu na akamfwatile.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Baho Lawi akamwandalie Yesu lihungu likomi mukaye lyake. Lipinga likomi lya vanyamula usulu na vanu vangi vakali vekalile pamwinga navo. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Ila vamonga Vafalisayo na vamonga Vawulanichi va Malagicho vakavaswigwime vachulila va Yesu vakilonga, “Wuli mwiliya na kunyuwa pamwi na vanyamula usulu na vene sambi vangi?”<verse eid="LUK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yesu akavahigile, “Venye wumi se vikela mlami, vevakumkela mlami nde vala vatamwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Sendachile kuvakemela vanu vasanzi, bali vanu venye sambi, vavese kuhongecha.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ihuchwa luchowo lwa kudinda kulya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matayo 9.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maliko 2.18-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Vanu vangi vakamlongie Yesu, “Vachulila va Yohani Mbatisa vidindaga kuliya na kumsuka Nguluvi, hata vachulila va Vafalisayo vigita ndeni. Wuli vachulila vako veliya na kunyuwa?”<verse eid="LUK 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yesu akavahuchile, “Wuli, vala vanu vevalalikwe kulihungu lya kutola vitakilwa vadinde kuliya kinu na mtwa va lihungu lya kutola agehe pamwi navo? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Ila kigono kikwacha nene mtwa lihungu Mtwa va lihungu baho iwonesa kuva Yesu pendihechwa na baho pemudinda kulia.”<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Yesu akavalongie mufano ugu, “Vanu sevitegula kipapi kya mwenda mumiya na kuvika mumwenda weusakiye, ngita vigita ndena, ivecha iyanangike mwenda mmya na kila kipapi kuhuma mumwenda mmya sekiwana na ula mwenda weusakie. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Kwihela munu yeivika difwayi miya mukihako kya ngwembe ihofu. Ngita peigita ndena difwayi miya ibachula ikyo kihako na difwayi isukuka na kihako cha ngwembe kikwanangika. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Difwayi itakilwa kuvikwa mukihako kya ngwembe miya. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Kwihela munu yeinyuwa difwayi yadaha baho isaka kunyuwa difwayi imya kangi ilonga, ‘Difwayi yadaha nofu.’”<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesu nde Mtwa va Kigono kya Kutulula</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matayo 12.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maliko 2.23-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Kigono kimwi kya Kutulula, Yesu na vachulila vake vakali vichumba mu mgunda lwa upemba. Vachulila vake vavangile ku denya mihocho gya upemba, vakanyukile mumawoko gyawo na kulia. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Vamonga Vafalisayo vakavahucha vachulila, “Wuli mwigita kinu kyekikanilwe mukigono kya Kutulula?”<verse eid="LUK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yesu akavahigile, “Wuli semkwimbile kye agitile Dawudi pamwi na vayage pevali na njala? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Dawudi akaingile mukaye lya Nguluvi, akanyamue gila mibumunda yeihechilwe kwa Nguluvi, akalie na ndenandena akavagavile vayage. Malagicho ikumkanila munu kulia mibumunda igo ila vatekechi hela” <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Yesu akavalongie, “Mwana va munu ndi Mtwa va Kigono kya Kutulula.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ekumnanicha munu munya liwoko lugaso</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matayo 12.9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maliko 3.1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Kigono kingi kya Kutulula, Yesu ingie mu Kaye lya Kutang'anila Vayawudi na kuvawulanicha. Mula mugati kukali na munu munya liwoko lyandeo lyelugasile. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Vafalisayo na vawulanichi va malagicho vakali visaka nongwa lya kumulata Yesu, ifyo vakali vakumlolela kwa pepi neke valole ngita ngaamnaniche munu mu Kigono kya Kutulula. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Ila Yesu achelile mahocho gawo, akamlongie yula munu munya liwoko lugaso, “Wime kwime pagatigati.” Yula munu akahele kwima pagatigati. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Baho, Yesu akavahuchile vawulanicha va Malagilicho na Vafwalisayo, “Kuhumila na Malagilicho gyetu, nde unofu Kigono kya Kutulula kugita lukani lunofu awu kugita lukani luhofu? Kunanicha wumi va munu awu kumdocha?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Akavalolile vanu vonda vevagehe baho, baho akamlongile yula munu munya liwoko lugaso, “Gonjolola liwoko lyako!” Akagitile ngita Yesu peamlongie na liwoko lyake ukananilwe.<verse eid="LUK 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Ila vawulanichi va malagicho na Vafalisayo vakavipile hilo, vakalonganile vamgitile liki Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ihagula vanjagila chumi na vavili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matayo 10.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maliko 3.13-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Mufigono ifyo Yesu akakang'ie pakidunda kufunya, ekalile meho pamie wonda ekumsuka Nguluvi. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Kilawu lyake, Yesu akavakemelie vachulila vake na mugati lyawo akavahaguwe vanu chumi na vavili yeavakemelie vanjagila. <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Simoni, Yesu amgavile litawa lingi Peteli na Andelea lukololo vake Simoni, Yakobo na Yohani na Filipo na Batolomeo, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Matayo na Tomasi na Yakobo mwana va Alifayo na Simoni yeakemeliwe Selote, mana lyake mtovanila inyi lya Isilaeli. <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Yuda Mwana va Yakobo na Yuda Sikalioti, pambele achile kumkana Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu iwulanicha na kuvananicha vanu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Matayo 4.23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Yesu peikile kukidunda pamwi na vanjagila vake, akaimile mulitava na lipinga likomi lya vachulila vake. Lipinga likomi lya vanu yevahumile inyi chonda cha Yudea na mwani va Yelusalemu na yevahumile mumbwani lya mwani lya Tilo na Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Vanu havo vakaachile kumpulikicha Yesu na kunanichwa matamwa gyawo. Vanu vonda vevagudilwe na mahoka mihafu vakaachile vakananichilwe. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Vanu vonda vasakile kumbyalisa Yesu, kwakuva ludali lwa Nguluvi lukali lwihuma na kuvananicha vanu vonda.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukeduka na kusugwima</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Matayo 5.1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Yesu avalolie vachulila vake na kuvalongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">“Mufunyilwe nyenye vahangala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">kwakuva Ung'achale va Nguluvi ndi venu.<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Vafunyilwe nyenye yemwigehe na njala nonde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">kwakuva pambele mugwita.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">Mufunyilwe nyenye yemuvemba nonde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">Kwakuva pambele mwiheka.<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />“Mufunyilwe nyenye vanu pevakuvavipila na kuvanenga na kuvaliga na kuvalonga nyenye nde vawofu, kwakuva lya litawa lya Mwana va Munu. <verse eid="LUK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Baho pamwandi vagogolo vetu vakavagitila ndeni Vavichi va Nguluvi, ndeni njowo icho pegivahumila, mukeduke na kukina, kwakuva mwipatila fupo ngomi kuluhano.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Ila damwilava nyenye vamosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:24">kwakuva mpatile suwe lukeduko lwenu.<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Damwilava nyenye mwemgwite nonde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">kwakuva pambele mwipulika njala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">Damwilava nyenye yemwiheka nonde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">kwakuva pambele mwikivilicha na kuvemba.<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />“Damwilava nyenye vanu pevakuvanjuma, kwakuva endehe nde vagogolo vawo vakavagitilie vavichi va udesi.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvakela vachwindama</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Matayo 5.38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7.12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />“Ila ndikuvalongela nyenye yemukunipulikicha, muvakele vachindwama venu, muvagitile unofu vala vevakuvavipila. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Muvasukile lufunyo kwa Nguluvi vala yevevakutola avagitile njowo nofu, muvasukile kwa Nguluvi vala vevakuvagitila mawofu. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Ngita munu peakutovile njeche limwi msedukile na njeche lingi. Munu peakunyagile mwenda vako filafila mlekele na ligwanda lyako. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Munu yeakusuka mgavile, ngita munu akikunyanga mali chako bihile kumlongela akuwisile. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Muvagitile vanu vangi kila kyemkela nyenye vavagitile.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />“Ngita mkuvakela vala yevakuvakela nyenye, mwipata fupo liki? Kwihela! Ata venye sambi vakuvakela vanu yevakuvakela. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Ngita mkivagitila manofu vala vanu yevakuvagitila manofu, mwipata fupo liki? Ata vene sambi ugita ndeni. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Ngita mukivakopela vala vekumchindila vakuvahomba, mwipata fupo liki? Ata venye sambi huvakopela vayao na kuhocha davawisilwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Ila nyenye muvakele vachindwama venu na kuvagitila manofu, muvakopele, mbihile kuhocha kuwisilwa. Baho, fupo lyenu livecha likomi na pemwigita ndeni mwigita ndeni ndeni ngita vana va Nguluvi yeagehe kukyanya lya kila kinu pevang'ang'wa kugita. Kwakuva mwene ndi msanzi kwa vala vevihela luhongecho na vala vawofu. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Muveche na lusungu ngita Daada venu yeagehe na lusungu.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvahinga vanu vangi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Matayo 7.1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />“Mbihile kuvahiga vanu vangi na Nguluvi sevakuvahiga, mbihile kuvagitila vayenu mawofu na Nguluvi sevakuvagitila mawofu, muvawonile lusungu vangi na Nguluvi vekuvawonela lusungu. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Muvagavile vanu vangi finu fefikela na Nguluvi akuvagavila kyemkela. Mwiwanuka mumawoko gyenu kigelo kye kimemile na kukingindwa mbaka kusukuka, kwakuva kigelo kikila kyemwitumila kwa vangi ndikyo Nguluvi itumila kwa nyenye ndeni.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Baho Yesu akavalongie mufano ugu, “Wuli yeabofwike meho ivesa kumwongocha yeabofwike meho muyage? Pevagita ndena vonda vegwilila mulilindi. <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Kwihela mchulila yekumgina muwulanichi vake, ila kila mchulila peisinda mawulanichi ivecha ngita muwulanichi vake.<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />“Wuli wilolela kibako mumeho lya lukololo vako, ila seukulilola libiki leligehe mumeho gako? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Awu, wiwesa kumlongela lukololo vako, ‘Lukolo vangu, leke ndikuheche kibako mumeho gako,’ Na kuno seukuilola libiki leligehe mumeho gyako? Veve mfyangu! Heche tandi libiki leligehe mumeho gyako, baho wilola unofu na kuhecha kibako kyekigehe mumeho mwa lukololo vako.<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Libiki lichwelwa kwa manunu gyake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Matayo 7.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12.33-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />“Libiki linofu seliwesa kubaba manunu mawofu, filafila kwihela libiki liwofu seliwesa kubaba manunu manofu. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Vanu huchela libiki kwa manunu gyake. Kwakuva vanu sevinokola mapela mumihomi, vala sevinokola sabibu mumiswampondo. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Munu msanji huhecha manofu gegagehe munumbula lyake na munu muwofu uhumicha mawofu kuhuma munumbula lyake. Kwakuva munu ulonga njowo chechimemile mnumbula lyake.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vachengaji vavili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Matayo 7.24-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />“Wuli mukunikemela ‘Mtwa, Mtwa,’ Na kuno semwigita gala gendikuvalongela? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Ndikuvawonesa ewoneka wuli munu yeyonda yula yeikwacha kwanene na yeipulikicha njowo changu na kuchigita. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Huyu iwana na munu yeichengile kaye lyake, agimile panyi hilo na kuvika musingi pakyanya paliganga, kukahumile na ulava na kuitova yila kaye ila seihogosike kwakuva ichengilwe unofu. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Ila munu yeyonda yeipulikicha njowo changu na seigita ngita peitakilwa, uyo iwana na munu yeachengile kaye pakyanya lya muhanga na seagimile musingi, ulava gakahumile na kuhogosa kaye ikague na kwanangika tukutuku!”<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ekumnanicha mnyigendwa mkomi va vapuga va ku Lumi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Matayo 8.5-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Yesu peasindile kulonga gala geasakile vanu va pulike, akahele mwani va Kapelinaumu. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Ukoya kukali na mkomi yumwi va vapuga va ku Lumi yeakali na mnyigendwa vake yeamkelile hilo. Mchulila yula akali mtamwa agehe pepi kufuwa.<figure style="fig" file="08 Centurion.jpg" size="col" ref="7.2">Mpuga va Valumi</figure> <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Yula mkomi va vapunga peapulike luchowo lwa Yesu, akavalagiche vamonga lya vavaha va Kiyawudi vahele vakamsuke ache kumnanicha mchulila vake. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Pevafikile kwa Yesu, vamsukile hilo, vakilonga, “Munu uyu ndi unofu atangwe, <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />kwakuva akuvakela vanu vetu na atuchengie kaye lyetu lya kutang'anila.”<verse eid="LUK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Baho, Yesu akahele pamwi navo. Peakali pepi kufikila kukaye lya mkomi va vapuga, yula mkomi va vapuga akavalagiche vaganja vake vamlongie Yesu, “Mtwa ubihile kwisumbula, kwakuva nene sendidikilwa uwingile kukaye lyangu. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Ndi mana sendayiwene ndidikilwa kwacha kwa veve. Ila longe luchowo hela, mchulila vangu inana. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Kwakuva nene ndi munu yendigehe panyi lya umwimike, ila ndinago na vapuga yevagehe panyi lyangu. Ndikimlongea yumwi, ‘Helele!’ Mwene ihelela na ndikimlongela yungi, ‘Wache!’ Mwene ekwacha na pendikumlongela mchulila vangu, ‘Gite kinu ikyo!’ Mwene igita.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Yesu peapulike njowo icho, akadudwive hilo, akausedukie wula lipinga lya vanu lelikali lilongochana, akalongile, “Ndakyene ndikuvalongela sendimuwene munu yeyonda mu Isilaeli yeali na mbatwa ngita iyi!”<verse eid="LUK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Vala vanu vevalagichwe pevawuyile kwa mkomi va vapuga va ku Lumi, vamuwene yula mchulila ananile.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ekumchulubucha mwana va maye mwigane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Pambele ludodo, Yesu akahele ku mwani weukemeliwe Naini na vachulila vake, lipinga likomi lya vanu vakalongochine. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Peakali pepi na mlyangilo mkomi va mwani, vahumie vanu vamnyamuwe lifimba lya mdimi, mwana yeiyena va maye mwigane. Vanu volofu va mwani wula vakali pamwi na maye yula. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Mtwa Yesu peamwene maye yula, akamwonie lusungu, akamlongie, “Bihile kuvemba.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Baho ahegelie pepi akalibyalisa lila luhaga, vala vevakali vamnyamue vakaemile, Yesu alongile, “Mdimi! Ndikulongela wime!” <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Yula mdimi yeafue akalamwika na akalile na akavanga kulonga. Yesu akamyamue akamsindike kwa maye.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Vanu vonda vakaogofya, vavangile kumunjuma Nguluvi vakilonga, “Mvichi mkomi va Nguluvi atuhumile mugati yetu. Nguluvi achile kuvawokola vanu vake.”<verse eid="LUK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Njowo icho cheagitile Yesu chikalutie ponda muinyi lya Yudea na ku inyi chonda cha pepi.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vananzi kuhuma kwa Yohani Mbatisa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Matayo 11.2-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Vachulila va Yohani vakamlongela Yohani gala gonda ga agitile Yesu, baho Yohani akavakemelie vachulila vake vavili, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />akavalagiche kwa Mtwa Yesu vamuwuche, “Veve ndi yula yealongile Yohani kuva daukwacha awu tumchindile yungi?”<verse eid="LUK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Vala vachulila pevafikeli kwa Yesu vakamlongie, “Yohani mbatisaji atulagiche tukuwuche, ‘Veve ndi yula yula yealongilwe kuva daukwacha awu tumchindile yungi?’”<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Chipindi icho icho, Yesu akavawonela lusungu na akavananicha vanu volofu vevakali vagudile kwa utamwa na kuvahecha mahoka na kuvananicha vanu vevabofwike meho, valole. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Baho akavahigile vala vachulila va Yohani, “Muwuye mkamlongie Yohani gyonda gemgalolile na kugapulika. Vevabofwike meho vilola, vatenda vigenda na venye lukalavilo vinanichwa na vadinda matu vipulika na yevafuwe vichulubushwa na vahangala vadalikiwa Njowo Nofu. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Nguluvi daifunywa munu yula yeseivipiswa na nene.”<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Vachulila va Yohani pevahegile, Yesu avangile kuvalongela wula lipinga lya vanu makani ga Yohani Mbatisa, “Pemuhele kudasi mkahele kulola liki? Wuli mwikali mwilolela lidete lwelihogoswa na lukala? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Mukahelele kulola liki? Mukahele kulola munu yeafwalile myenda minofu? Vanu vevifwala myenda minofu na kwikala maisa manofu vikala mukaye lya vang'achale. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Suwe mnilongele, mkahele kulola liki? Mkahele kumlola mvichi? Ndakyene, yemuwene ndi kugina mvichi va Nguluvi. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Yohani nde yeilongwa Mumasimbo ga Nguluvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:27">‘Nguluvi akalongie ndikumlagicha mchulila vangu akulongole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:27">daikuvikila unofu ng'asi lyako.’” <verse eid="LUK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Yesu akamalile kwakulonga, “Ndikuvalongela, mugati mwa vanu vonda kwihela yeakali mkomi kumgina Yohani Mbatisa, hata ifyo yula yeakali mdodo hilo pa ung'achale va Nguluvi ndi mkomi kuchumba Yohani.”<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Pevapulike njowo icho cha Yesu vanu vonda na vanyamula usulu vakamdikile Nguluvi na vakabatiswa na Yohani Mbatisa. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Ila Vafalisayo na vawulanichi va Malagicho vakakanile gala gaalagiche Nguluvi kwajili lyawo vavene, vakanile kubatiswa na Yohani.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yesu akagendelie kulonga, “Vanu va kilelo iki ndivawananise na kinu liki? Vewana na kiki? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Vawo viwana na vana vevakalile kusoko na kwikemela lipinga lingi na lingi, ‘Tukavatovie mluli ila semkakinile! Twimbile msambo cha kusungwima ila semvembile!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Yohani mbatisaji achile, sealiye vala seanyuwe difwayi, nyenye mkalongile, ‘Aingilwe na mahoka!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Mwana va Munu achile, iliya na kunyuwa, nyenye mwilonga, ‘Lole, muhodo na mgala, mganja vao vanyamula usulu na venye sambi!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Ila uginyange va Nguluvi iwonike kuva nofu kwa vonda vasanzi.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mukaye mwa Simoni Mfalisayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Mfalisayo yumwi akamlalike Yesu kulia kyakulia kya palumie mukaye lyake, Yesu akaingie pakaye pa yula Mfalisayo na ekalile kulia kyakulia. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Ukoya ku mwani kukali na maye yumwi munya sambi. Peapatile lukani kuva Yesu agehe pakaye pa yula Mfalisayo, akaachile na kyupa yeimemile manung'ililo yeigalanichwe na liganga lya alabasata. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Akaimile pepi na migulu gya Yesu, peavemba na mahochi gake gakamgwilie Yesu mumagulu gake. Maye yula akaipyangusile migulu kwa fwili chake. Baho akainonile magulu na kubaka gala manung'ililo. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Yula Mfalisayo yeamlalikile Yesu Peagalolile hago, akahochile munumbula lyake, “Ngita munu uyu ndakyene nde mvichi va Nguluvi, angemuchela mdala uyu yeamkolelie ndi munu agehe wuli, angemchela kuva munya sambi.”<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yesu akamlongie yula Mfalisayo, “Simoni, ndinakyo kinu kya kukulongela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">Simoni akamlongie, “Ndakyene, Muwulanichi ndongie.”<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Yesu akamlongie, “Vanu vavili vakali vaasimie sendi kwa munu yeiyasimisa sendi, yumwi akali asimie fipande fya madini gye gikemelwa fesa na yungi miya chiano. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Vonda vavili sevavesile kumuhomba, munu yula avawonie lusungu vonda vavili. Nonde nde ani pagati lya vavili havo damkela hilo munu yula?”<verse eid="LUK 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simoni akahigile, “Ndihocha yula yeawoneliwe lusungu sendi chingi nde yula dakumkela hilo munu yula.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">Yesu akamlongie, “Uhigile unofu.” <verse eid="LUK 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Baho Yesu akamsedukie yula mdala na kumlongela Simoni, “Ukumlola maye uyu? Pendiingie baha pakaye lyako seukanigavile malega ga kukalava migulu gyangu, ila mdala uyu anikalafiche migulu gyangu kwa mahochi gake na kunifyangula kwa fwili chake. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Veve seunihungile kwa kuninonela, ila uyu maye kuhuma pendiingie baha akali akwinonela migulu gyangu. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Veve Seukabakile mtuwe vangu mafuta, ila uyu maye andibakile manung'ililo magulu gyangu. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Kwa ndena ndikulongela alekilwe sambi chake chongofu kwakuva anikelie hilo. Ila munya kulekelwa sambi ndodo hukela kidodo.”<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Baho Yesu akamlongie yula maye, “Ulekilwe sambi chako.”<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Vamonga va vanu vevakali bahala vakavangile kulongana, “Munu uyu ndi ani mbaka kulekela sambi?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Yesu akamlongie yula maye, “Mbatwa lyako ikuwokole, helele kwa utengamaso.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Vadala vevalongochine na Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Pambele Yesu achumbie kumwani na kufijiji kuno akuvadalikila vanu Njowo Nofu cha ung'achale va Nguluvi. Na vala vachulila chumi na vavili vakahelele pamwi na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />Akalongochine na vadala vamonga yeavahechile mihoka na kuvananicha matamwa. Vadala havo vakali Malia yeahumile ku Magidala, yeahechilwe mahoka saba, <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />na Yoana mdala va Kusa, mnyigendwa mkomi mulidamwa lya Helode na Susana na vadala vangi volofu. Vadala havo vakatumile mali chawo kumgundamikila Yesu na vachulila vake.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufano va munu mvyala mbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matayo 13.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maliko 4.1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Kigono kimwi mapinga makomi ga vanu gakali gakwilundasa kuhuma kila mwani na vakumuhelelea Yesu. Na Yesu akavalongie mufano ugu.<verse eid="LUK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />“Munu yumwi akahele kuvyala mbeyu chake. Peagehe imicha mbeyu icho, chingi chaguwe mung'asi, vanu pevagendile vakachikinyile na fidege fyalie. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Mbeyu chingi chaguwe mumganga wene maganga, pechimelile chigamile kwakuva kukali kwihela unyinyafu mumganga. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Mbeyu chingi chaguwe mumibiki gya mihomi, gila mihomi na mbeyu chakulile pamwinga, mihomi ikaikekeneka mimelo igo. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Mbeyu chingi chaguwe mumhanga mnofu, chamelile na kubaba ilo.” Peamalile kulonga ago, akalonga luchowo lwake, alongile, “Munu yeali na masigicha gakupulikicha na agapulikiche!”<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wuli ekuwulanicha kwa mufano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matayo 13.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Maliko 4.10-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Vachulila vake Yesu vakamuhuchile mana lya mufano ugo. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Yesu akahigile, “Nyenye mugaviliwe umwimike va kuchela undakyene va ung'achale va Nguluvi weufihilwe pamwandi nonde uchelilwe, ila havo vangi ndiywanga navo kwa mifano, neke valole vabihile kulola, pevipulika vabihile kuchela.”<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ihumulila mfanu va munu yeahele kuvyala mbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matayo 13.18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Maliko 4.13-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />“Suwe mana lya mufano ugu ndi iyi, mbeyu ndi luchowo lwa Nguluvi. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Mbeyu chila chechague mung'asi ndi vala vanu yevipulika luchowo lwa Nguluvi na setani ehelela na kulihecha munumbula chawo, neke vabihile kwidikila na kuwokoka. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Mbeyu chila chechague mumganga wene maganga ndi vala vanu pevipulika luchowo lwa Nguluvi na kuliwanuka kwa lukeduko na vene vihela midadikwa, na pevigechwa vekulileka luchowo lwa Nguluvi. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Mbeyu chila chechiguwe mumibiki gya mihomi nde vanu vala yevipulika lila luchowo lya Nguluvi, bahobaho pevikwendelela ludodo luchowo lwa Nguluvi lihanangwa na magudo na lukeduko na maisa manofu. Vanu havo sevikula mu mbwatwa lyao. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Mbeyu chila chechaguwe pa muhanga mnofu nde vala vanu vevipulika luchowo lwa Nguluvi, vakulikolela na kwidikila kwa numbula chawo na kufumilia na kwendelela kugita njowo chechikumkelisa Nguluvi.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chibatali chekigubikwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Maliko 4.21-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />“Vanu sevikwasa chibatali na kugubikwa na kiviya awu kuvikwa panyi pa ulili. Ila vanu huivika pakwanya pa kisusu neke vanu pevukwingila mugati vavese kulola welu.<verse eid="LUK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />“Ifyoifyo kinu kyokyonda kyekifihiliwe kivecha pelu pee na kinu kyokyonda kyekigubikwe kichelwa na kuvikwa pawelu.<verse eid="LUK 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />“Mwilole na pemkugapulikicha, kwakuva munu yeage na kinu hulutichilwa, ila yeseagehe na kinu inyagwa hata kila kidodo kyeinakyo.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vakolo va undakyene va Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matayo 12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maliko 3.31-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Baho maye vake Yesu na vakololo vake Yesu vakamuhelelie, ila sevawesile kuhelela pepi lyake kwakuva kukali na lipinga likomi lya vanu. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Munu yumwi akamlongie Yesu, “Maye vako na lukololo vako vaimile kwivala visaka kukulola.”<verse eid="LUK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Ila Yesu avalongie vanu vonda, “Maye vangu na lukololo vangu nde vala yevipulika luchowo lwa Nguluvi na kulidikila.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu epolecha lukala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matayo 8.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Maliko 4.35-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Kigono kimwi, Yesu akakang'ie wato pamwi na vachulila vake, akavalongie, “Tuhagame kumwambo lya lihiva.” Baho vavangile lugendo. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Pevali mulugendo, Yesu avasile tulo. Bahobaho likala likomi likavanga kupuga mulihiva, malenga gavangile kwingila mugati lya wato na vonda vasakile kudibala. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Vala vachulila vakamhelelie Yesu, vakamlamuse vakilonga, “Mtwa, Mtwa! Twidibala!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Yesu kalamka, akaulakila likala na madaba gya malenga, nago gakatulie, kukali kunofu. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Avalongie, “Mbatwa lyenu igehe kwiya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Ila vene vakadudwive vakaogofya kuno vakwilongela, “Munu uyu ndi ani? Yeilakilila lukala na madaba gikumdikila!”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumnanicha munu munya mihoka lihafu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matayo 8.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maliko 5.1-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Yesu na vachulila vake vakaendelie na lugendo, vakafikile muinyi lya Vagelasi, yeigee kumwambo lya lihiva ku Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Yesu peikali ikwika muwato, akahelele muling'umbung'umbu lya lihiva, akatang'ana na munu yumwi yekali na mahoka. Munu huyu seafwalige myenda kwa figono fyolofu, vala seihela kaye, ila akali ikwikala muugono. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Peamwene Yesu akavembile akamgwilie Yesu, baho akabwatile, “Veve Yesu Mwana va Nguluvi yeagehe kukyanya va finu fyonda, ukela liki kwa nene? Ndikusuka ubihile kuniguda!” <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Munu uyu alongile yendena kwakuva Yesu akali amlakalile yula lihoka lihafu amuhege. Lihoka lila likali likumwingilaga munu uyu, hata ngita vanu vakumuhopa mawoko na magulu gyake kwa ndegei gya kyuma, mwene akali akwichidumula ndegei icho cha kyuma na mahoka vakamsindike mbaka kuwelu.<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yesu amuhuchiche, “Litawa lyako ani?” Amhigile, “Litawa lyangu ndi ‘Lipinga’” Kwakuva akali na mihoka myolofu. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Havo mihoka vamsukile Yesu abihile kuvasindika mulilindi selihela mwiso.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Pono pala pakali na lipinga likomi lya migubi muligema lya kidunda veliya. Suwe mahoka mahafu gakamsukile Yesu vavaingile vala vangubi, Yesu akavaleka vavaingile. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Mahoka hago gamuhumile yula munu, kwingila kwa ngubi, lipinga lyonda lya vangubi vakanyilie palingema lya Galilaya, vakafwilie mumalenga.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Vala vakwamila ngubi pevalolile gala gegahumile vakanyilie, kuvalandulila vanu njowo icho mumwani na mufijiji. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Vanu vachile kulola gegahumile. Pevafikile kwa Yesu, vakamwene yula munu yeananichwe mahoka ekalile pepi na Yesu kuno afwalile mwenda na luhala lwake chikamuwuyile kangi, vanu vonda vakaogofya. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Vala vanu yevalolile kyegihumile vakavahumulile munu munya mahoka peananichwe. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Vanu va inyi lya Gelasi vakaogofya hilo. Ndeni, vakamsukile Yesu ahege. Ifyo Yesu akaingile muwato, neke ahege. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Yula munu yeahumilwe na lihoka lihafu akamsukile ahege pamwi nave.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:38">Ila Yesu akamkanile na kumlongela, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />“Wuye pakaye, ukavahumulile vanu kila kyeakugitile Nguluvi.” Ifyo yula munu akahele kumwani yonda akavalongela vanu fila Yesu gyeamgitile.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anamnanicha mdala filafila akumchulubua mhinja va Yailo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matayo 9.18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Maliko 5.21-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Yesu peawuyile palubali lungi lwa lihiva, lipinga lya vanu vakamwanuke kwa ukeduko, kwakuva vonda vakali vekumchindila. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Baho akaachile munu yumwi yeakemeliwe Yailo, mkomi va kaye lya kutang'anila Vayawudi. Akafugamile pautalo lya Yesu, akamsukile ahele kukaye lyake, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />kwakuva muhinja vake iyena, yeakali na myaka chumi na givili, akali pepi kufua.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Yesu peakali ihelela, vanu vakali vakumkekenecha kila paubali. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Mulipinga lila lya vanu kukali na mdala yumwi, yeakali na luholovela lya danda kwa myaka chumi na givili, akasindile sendi chake chonda kwa valami, ila kwihela munu yeyonda yeawesile kumnanicha. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Mdala huyo akamuhelelie Yesu kumbele na kubyalisa ubindo lwa mwenda lwa Yesu, bahobaho danda ikamlekile kumuhuma. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yesu akahuchile, “Ndi ani yeanibyalise?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Vanu vonda vakakanile. Peteli akamlongie, “Mtwa, lipinga lya vanu likuchungutile na kukukekeneka!”<verse eid="LUK 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Ila Yesu akalongile, “Agehe munu yeanibyalise, kwakuva ndewene ludali lwangu chimnaniche munu.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Yula mdala pealolile kuva seiwesa kwifiya, ahumile kuno itetema, akafugamile pautalo lya Yesu. Kavanga kuvahumulila vanu vonda wuli ambyalise Yesu na bahobaho akananichwe. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Yesu akamlongie, “Maye, mbatwa lyako ikunaniche. Bite na utengamaso.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Yesu peakali have kulonga, akaachile mnyigendwa kuhuma kaye lya mkomi Yailo, akamlongile Yailo “Muhinja vako afuwe, bihile kumsumbula muwulanichi.”<verse eid="LUK 8:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Yesu peapulike ago, akamlongie Yailo, “Bihile kwogofya, dikile hela na muhinja vako dainana.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Peafikile kukaye lya Yailo, akavakanila vanu vabihile kwingila mugati pamwinga, ila vahingile Peteli na Yohani na Yakobo na vasasi va yula mwana muhinja. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Vanu vonda vakali vivemba na kukivilicha, Yesu avalongie, “Mbihile kuvemba kwakuva mwana seafuwe ila avasile tulo hela!”<verse eid="LUK 8:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Vanu vonda vakamuhekile Yesu, kwakuva vachelile kuva muhinja yula afuwe. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Ila Yesu akamkolile liwoko na kumlongela, “Mwana, lamke!” <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Uwumi vake ikamuwuyile muhinja yula, bahobaho akalamwike. Baho Yesu akavalongie vamgavile kyakuliya. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Vasasi vake vadudwive, ila Yesu akavakanile vabihile kumulongela munu yeyonda njowo chechahumile.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvalagicha vachulila vake chumi na vavili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matayo 10.5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maliko 6.7-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Yesu avakemelie vachulila vake kumi na vavili, akavagavile ludali na umwimike va kuhecha mihoka na kuvananicha vatamwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Baho avalagiliche vahelele kuvadalikila vanu njowo cha Ung'achale va Nguluvi na kuvananicha vatamwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Avalongie, “Pemwigenda mbihile kunyamula kyokyonda, mbihile kunyamula lusaga, vala muhako, vala kyakuliya, vala sendi, vala mwenda wungi. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Kaye yeyonda yemukwingila na kuvawanuka, mwikale mbaka pemwihega umwani hugo. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Vanu vakilema kuvaanuka, muwege mumwani ugo, pemwihega mupumune lifuna mumagulu gyenu iveche kimanyilo kuva avakanile.”<verse eid="LUK 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Ifyo vachulila havo vakavangile lugendo, vakachumbile mufijiji kuno vakidalika vanu Njowo Chinofu na kuvananicha vatamwa kila pono.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'achale Helode aingilwe na wogofi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matayo 14.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maliko 6.14-29</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Helode yeakali ng'achale va ku Galilaya, akapulikile njowo chonda chechikali chigitilwe na Yesu, mwene akahogofya kwakuva vanu volofu vakali vakilonga, “Yohani mbatisaji achulubuke!” <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Vangi valongie kuva Elia yeakali mvichi va Nguluvi ahumie na vangi valongie kuva yumwi va mvichi va daha achulubuke. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Ila Helode akalongie, “Yohani ndikamdumule mtuwe, ndi ani yendipulika njowo chake?” Nave akasakile kumlola.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ekuvagavila kyakula vanu elufu chihanu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matayo 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maliko 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohani 6.1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Vala vanjagila pevawuyile, vakamlongie Yesu gyonda gevagitile. Yesu akavategula vanjagila vake hela, akahelela navo mwani va Betisaida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Ila vala vanu pevachelile peahelele, vakamfwatile. Yesu akavaanuke, akaywangile navo njowo cha Ung'achale va Nguluvi, akavananiche vala yevasakile kunanichwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Lichuwa pelivangile kudibala, vala vachulila chumi na vavili vakamuhelelie Yesu na vakamlongie, “Uvalage vanu vahelele kufijiji na migunda fya pepi, vapatile kyakula na pono pa kuvasa, kwakuva baha petugehe ndi kudasi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Ila Yesu akavalongie, “Mwavene muvagavile kyakula.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Vakamuhigile, “Nefwe tunagyo mibumunda mihanu na somba vavili hela. Wuli ukela tuhelele kuvagulila kyakula vanu hava vonda?” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Pono pala kukali na vagosi elufu chihanu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Yesu akavalongie vachulila vake, “Muvalongele vanu vakale mumapinga lya vanu na kila lipinga liveche na vanu hamsini.”<verse eid="LUK 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Vachulila vakagitile ngita pevalongilwe vanu vonda vakakalile panyi. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Baho Yesu akanyamue gila mibumunda mihanu na somba vavili, akalolile kuluhano akamlumba Nguluvi, akavifunyile. Baho kaiketula mibumunda na somba, akavagavile vachulila vake vavagavile vanu. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Vanu vonda vakalie na kugwita. Vachulila vakaholasa masigalio gya mibumunda na gya somba, vakamemiche findilu kyumi na givili.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peteli ilandula kuva Yesu ndive Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Matayo 16.13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Maliko 8.27-29</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Kigono kimwinga Yesu akali isuka weka hela na vachulila vake vakamuhelelie. Yesu akavahuchile, “Wuli vanu valonga nene nde ani?”<verse eid="LUK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Vene vakamuhigile, “Vanu vangi valonga veve nde Yohani Mbatisa na vangi Elia yeakali mvichi va Nguluvi na vangi vilonga veve ni yumwi va mvichi va daha yeachulubuke.”<verse eid="LUK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Baho akavahucha, “Nyenye mwilonga nene nde ani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Peteli akamuhigile, “Veve nde Kilisito yeaguliwe na Nguluvi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ilagula daigudwa na kufua kwa mwene</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Matayo 16.20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Maliko 8.30—9.1</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Baho Yesu akavalakilile hilo vabihile kumulongela munu yeyonda njowo ilyo.<verse eid="LUK 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Yesu akavalongie vachulila vake, “Mwana va Munu itakilwa apatile magudo hilo na kukanilwa na vagogolo na vatekechi vakomi na vawulanichi va malagicho. Na daidochwa, ila kigono kya udatu ichulubuka.”<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Baho akavalongie vanu vonda, “Munu yeyonda yeikela kunifwata nene, ajileme mwene, anyamule kipindilihicho lwake kila kigono, anifwatile. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Kwakuva munu yeikela kuwokola wumi lwake yumwene, akuyayagilicha, ila yeakuyayagilicha wumi lwake kwakunifuatila nene, daigawokola. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Wuli, munu ipatila liki ngita akiupata umosi vonda va inyi na kuno akiyagilicha wumi vake? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Munu yeakuniwonela nyoni nene na mawulanichi gyangu, Mwana va Munu ekumuwonela nyoni paikwacha paukomi vake na muukomi va Daada vake na vandumindumi vang'alili. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Ndakyene ndikuvalongela, vangi vagehe baha sevifuwa mbaka vauwene Ung'achale va Nguluvi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu iseduka wuso</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Matayo 17.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Maliko 9.2-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Pefichumbile figono finane paalongile hago, Yesu akavategule Peteli na Yohani na Yakobo, vakakang'ile pakidunda kumsuka Nguluvi. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Yesu peakali ekumsuka Nguluvi, wuso vake ukasedukile, myenda gyake gikali mivalafu pee. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Bahobaho vawonike vanu vavili vakali vaywanga na Yesu. Vanu havo vakali Musa na Elia, <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />vawonike paukomi va kuluhano, vakaywangile na Yesu njowo lya kufua, gyekikamilika ukoya ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Peteli pamwi na vayage vakali vavasile tulo, hata ifyo valamkile vawene wula ukomi va Yesu na vakavawene vala vanu vavili vevali vahemile pamwi nave. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Baho vanu vala vavili pevakali vahega, Peteli akamlongie Yesu, “Mtwa nde unofu nefwe tugehe baha! Suwe tuchenge fibudi fidatu, kimwi kyako na kimwi kya Musa na kimwi kya Elia.” Ndakyene Peteli seachelige elonga liki.<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Peteli peakali ilonga ago, bahobaho likahumile lifunde na likavagubika, vachulila vake vakaogofya lifunde pelikuvagubika. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Lichwi yapulikile kuhuma mulifunde, “Uyu nde mwana vangu yendimuhague, mumpulikiche mwene.”<verse eid="LUK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Lichwi peichikile, vakamuwonile Yesu agehe weka hela. Vachulila vekalile jii na sevakamlongie munu yeyonda njowo chevalolile figono ifyo.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumnanicha mdimi munya lihoka lihafu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Matayo 17.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Maliko 9.14-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Kilawu lyake Yesu na vachulila vake pevikile kula kidunda, lipinga likomi lya vanu lyatanganile na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Munu yumwi mulila lipinga akabwatile, “Muwulanichi! Ndikusuka mnaniche mwana vangu, mwana vangu yeiyena! <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Mahoka ekumbata na kumgita abwate, ekumgavila kilibisi na ahumilwe mafulofulo mumlomo. Uyo lihoka lihafu likumgudisa hilo na selikumleka kisatu. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Ndikavasukile vachulila vako vamheche lihoka lihafu ilyo, ila sevawesile.”<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yesu akavahigile, “Nyenye kilelo sekidikila na kiwofu! Ndikwikala na nyenye na kuvafumilia mbaka panili?” Baho akamlongie yula munu, “Mletile mwana vako baha.” <verse eid="LUK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Mdimi uyo peamuhelelie Yesu, yula lihoka lihafu likamgavile kilibisi. Ila Yesu akamlakilila yula lihoka lihafu, akamnaniche yula mwana mdimi na akamuwuyisile kwa daada vake. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Vanu vonda vakadudwive na umwimike ukomi va Nguluvi.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesu elonga kangi kufua kwa mwene</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matayo 17.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maliko 9.30-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Vala vanu pevali vave vadudwiva kwa njowo chonda cheagitile Yesu, mwene akavalongie vachulila vake, <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />“Mbihile kusemwa ikyi kyendikuvalongela, Mwana va Munu isindikwa mumawoko gya vanu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Ila vavo sevachele mana lya luchowo ulo, luchowo ulo lyafihilwe pawo neke vabihile kuchela, navo vakaogofya kumuhucha Yesu mana lya luchowo ulo.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nde ani yeagehe mkomi?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matayo 18.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maliko 9.33-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Vachulila vake vavangile kwiwucha, nde ani yeivecha mkomi pagati lyawo. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yesu agachelie mahocho gegagehe munumbula chawo, baho akamyamue mwana mdodo na kumvika pepi nave. <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />Akavalongie, “Munu yeyonda yeakumuwanuka mwana uyu kwa litawa lyangu, aniwanuke nene. Na munu yeyonda yeakuniwanuka nene amuwanuke mwene yeanilagiche. Kwakuva munu yeyonda yeagehe mdodo pagati lyenu nde mkomi mugati lyenu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesepinjana na nyenye agehe palubali lyenu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Maliko 9.38-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Yohani akamlongile Yesu, “Mtwa, tumwene munu yumwi ihecha vanu mahoka kwa litawa lyako tukamkanie, kwakuva mwene se yumwinga vetu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Yesu akamlongie Yohani na vachulila vangi, “Mbihile kumkanila, kwakuva mwene yesepinjana na nyenye agehe palubali lyenu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vanu va kijiji kimwi kya Samalia valema kumuwanuka Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Chipindi peukali pepi va Yesu kunyamuliwa kuhelela kuluhano kwa Nguluvi, Yesu alamule kuhelela ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Avalagiliche vananzi vamlongole, navo vahelelie ku mwani va Samalia kumwandalisia kila kinu, <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Ila venekaye va pala valema kumuwanuka Yesu kwakuva akali ihelela ku Yelusalemu <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Vachulila vake, Yohani na Yakobo, pevawonile ago, vakalongie, “Mtwa, wuli wisaka tuukemele lyoto ukwike kuhuma kuluhano uvanyanye vanu vonda?”<verse eid="LUK 9:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Yesu akavasedukile na kuvalakila. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Pambele Yesu na vachulila vake vakahele mu kijiji kingi.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vevidikilwa kumufwata Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Matayo 8.19-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Pevali mulugendo, munu yumwi akamulongie Yesu, “Dandikufwata kokonda kwewihelela.”<verse eid="LUK 9:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yesu akamuhigile, “Mikeve vana manga, fidege vana fiwaso ila Mwana va Munu ihela pono pa kutulula.”<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Baho Yesu akamlongie munu yungi, “Unifwate.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Ila munu huyo akalongile, “Mtwa leke tandi ndiwuyile ndikamsile daada vangu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yesu akamlongie, “Uvaleke vanu vevali vahafu munumbula lyao vasilwe na vevafuwe, ila veve helele ukavadalikie vanu Ung'achale va Nguluvi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Munu yungi akamlongie, “Mtwa ndikukufwata ila leke tandi ndikavalage vakololo vangu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yesu akamlongie, “Munu yeyonda yeipandula kuno ilolela kumbele seidikilwa kuva mnyigendwa va ung'achale va Nguluvi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvalagicha vachulila sabini na vavili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Pegachumbile ago, Mtwa Yesu akavahaguwe vachulila vangi sabini na vavili, akavalagiliche vavili vavili, valongole mu fijiji na pono paasakile Yesu kuhelela. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Akavalongie, “Mabenelo molofu, ila vanyigendwa vadodo. Mumsuke mtwa alagiche vanyigendwa mumgunda vake. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Muhelele! Ndikuvalagicha nyenye ngita ng'ondolo mugati lya mikeve. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Mbihile kunyamula fihondo fya sendi, vala muhako, vala makobasi na mbihile kumuhungila munu yeyonde mung'asi. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Pemwikwingila kaye yeyonda, tandi vahungileni yendee, ‘Mwikale kwa ulutengamaso mukaye ilyi!’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Ngita munu mkela ulutengamaso, ulutengamaso lwenu ukukala pamwi na mwene, ngita kuhela yeikela ulutengamaso, ulutengamaso lwenu ukuvawuyila. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Mukale mukaye yimwi, mukilia na kunyuwa kyokyonda kyemugavilwa, kwakuva mnyigendwa ing'ang'a kuhombwa sendi chake. Mwikale kaye yimwi, mbihile kuhega hega kuhelela kaye yingi. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Pemwingila kumwani vovonda na vanu vakivawanuka, muliye kyokyonda kyemugavilwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Muvananiche vatamwa vevali mumwani ugo, muvalongele vanu, ‘Ung'achale va Nguluvi ugehe pepi kwacha.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Ila pemwikwingila kumwani vovonda, ngita sevakuvawanuka, muchumbe mung'asi chawo, mlonge, <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‘Hata lifuna lya mwani lyenu lyeling'ang'anile mumagulu gyetu, tukuvapumunila nyenye, ivese kimanyilo kuva mwikotoliwe, ila muchele kuva Ung'achale va Nguluvi ugehe pepi kwacha.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Ndakyene ndikuvalongela, mukigono kya kuhiga nongwa, Nguluvi akuhiga nongwa ngomi mwani ugo kuchumba mwani va Sodoma ve vali vawofu.<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Damwilava vanu semwihongecha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Matayo 11.20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />“Mwilava vanu va Kolasini! Mwilava vanu va Betisaida! Kwakuva ngita umanyitu geigitilwe baha ngagagitilwe na ukoya Tilo na Sidoni, vanu vaukoya ngavafwalile myenda gya miloboto na kwibaka kifu kwiwonesa kuva vahongiche. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Mukigono kya kuhiga nongwa, Nguluvi davawonela lusungu vanu va mwani va Tilo na Sidoni kuchumba nyenye. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Nyenye vanu va Kapelinaumu, wuli, mwinjuma mbaka muinyi? Hamu, mwikwiswa mbaka kumafunde.”<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Yesu akavalongie vachulila vake, “Munu yeakuvapulika nyenye, ekunipulika nene na munu yekuvalema nyenye, ekunilema na nene. Na munu yekunilema nene, ekumlema yula yeanilagiliche.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwuya kwa vachulila sabini na vavili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Pambele, vala vachulila sabini na vavili vakawuyile kuno vagehe na lukeduko hilo, vakalongie, “Mtwa, kwa litawa lyako tukavalakila mahoka, navo vakagitile ngita petuvalongie.”<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Yesu akavalongie, “Ndamwene setani eguwa kuhuma kuluhano ngita lumuli. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Mpulike! Ndivagavile umwimike va kukinya liyoka na vinjemi na ludali va kumuwesa mchundwama, kwihela kinu kyokyonda kyekikuvalemacha. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Ila mbihile kukeduka kwakuva mihoka gikuvadikila, ila kedukeni kwakuva matawa genu gasimbilwe kuluhano, neke muveche vanu va Nguluvi.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ekeduka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Matayo 11.25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16">13.16</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:17">17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Saa yiyila, Yesu akedukile kwa umwimike va Muhe va Nguluvi, akalonga, “Ndikuhongecha veve Daada, Mtwa va kuluhano na inyi, kwakuva ugafyihile njowo ichi kwa vanu va uginyange na venye luhala na uvagubutulie vana vadodo. Ndakyene, Daada, ndene ndifyo ukeliye.”<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />Baho akalongie, “Daada vangu anigavile finu fyonda. Kwihela munu yeamcheliye mwana ila Dadi, vala kwihela munu yeamchela Daada ila Mwana, na vanu vala yevahaguliwe ugubutilwa na Mwana.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Akavasedukie vachulila vake na kulonga navo poono kuhela vanu, “Vafunyilwe vanu vala vevilola makani gala gemukugalola nyenye! <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Ndakyene ndikuvalongela, vavichi na vang'achale vadobokile kulola gala gemukugalola nyenye ila sevawesile kulola na kupulika gala gemukugapulika ila sevavesile kupulika.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msamalia msanji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Pambele muwalinichi yumwi va malagilicho akaimile, amgeche Yesu, akamuhucha, “Muwulanichi, ndigite liki neke nipatile wumi va mbepali?”<verse eid="LUK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yesu akamuhuchile, “Malagicho gilonga wuli? Uchela wuli?”<verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Munu uyo akamuhigile, “Mkele Mtwa Nguluvi vako kwa numbula lyako lyonda, kwa muhe vako vonda, kwa ludali chako chonda na kwa mahocho gyako gyonda. Na mkele muyago ngita weukijikela veve.”<verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Yesu akamlongie, “Uhigile unofu, gite aga dawikala.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Ila munu yula akasakile kwiwonesa kuva munu msanzi akamuhuchile Yesu, “Vapepi vangu ndi ani?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yesu akamuhigile, “Munu yumwi akali ekwika ku Yelusalemu kuhelela Yeliko, peakali mung'asi, vahichi vakambatile, vakamuhichila finu fyake vakamtova pepi kufua. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Baho akahumile mtekechi akali ikwika ng'asi yilayila, ila peamuwonile munu yula yeatovilwe akachumbile palubali. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Filafila Mulawi yumwi peafikile na kumlola munu yula yeatovilwe na mwene akachumbile palubali. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Ila Musamalia yumwi yeakali ichumba ng'asi yila. Peamuwonile akamuwonela lusungu. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Akamheleliye yula yeatovilwe akamuhogofiche fikong'o fyake kwa kumbaka mafuta na difwayi na kumuhopa kilepe. Baho akamkang'achile pakyanya lya lipunda lyake, akamsindikile kukaye lya vagenji na kumutamisa. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Kilawu lyake Msamaliya yula akamgavile fipande fivili fya madini gya sendi gya fesa munu munya kaye akamlongie, ‘Mtamiche munu uyu, pendiwuya ndikuwuyisila kyokyonda kyeatumile.’” <verse eid="LUK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Yesu akamuhuchile, “Pagati lya havo vadatu, nde ani vapepi va yula munu yeatovilwe na vahichi?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Yula muwulanichi va malagicho akamuhigile, “Nde yula yeamwonie lusungu.” Yesu akamlongie, “Na veve helele ukagite ngita peagitile yula Msamaliya.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ihelela mukaye mwa Malita na Maliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Yesu na vachulila vake pevakali mumagendo kuhelala ku Yelisalemu, vengie ku mwani wumwi na mdala yumwi yeikemelwa Malita, akampokela mukaye lyake. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Malita akali na muhachave yeakemeliwe Malia, uyu ekalile pepi na Mtwa Yesu na akali ipulikicha mawulanichi gyake. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Ila Malita akali igita kasi cholofu cha kugundamikila. Baho amhelelie Yesu, akamlongie, “Mtwa, nde seulola kuva muhacha vangu anilekie kasi chonda ndigite weka? Mlongele ache anitange.”<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Ila Mtwa amuhigile, “Malita, Malita, wigayangaya na kuguda kwa njowo cholofu. <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />Ila ligehe luchowo limwi hela linofu kuchumba chonda. Luchowo ilyo ndi kunipulika. Malia nde kalihaguwa na kwihela munu yeiwesa kumunyaga.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesu iwulanicha kumsuka Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Matayo 6.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7.7-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Kigono kimwinga, Yesu akali pono ekumsuka Nguluvi. Peamalile kumsuka Nguluvi, yumwi va vachulila vake akamlongie, “Mtwa, tukusuka utuwulaniche kusumka Nguluvi ngita Yohani Mbatisa paavawulaniche vachulila vake.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yesu akavalongie, “Pemwisuka Nguluvi, mwilonge yendena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">‘Daada</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">Litawa lyako linjumwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">Ung'achale vako ukwache.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Utugavile kyakulia kyetu kila kigono. <verse eid="LUK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Utuhechele sambi chetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">kwakuva nefwe tukuvalekela sambi vanu vonda yevatukosie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">vala bihile kutunyamuwa kutusindika mumagecho.’”<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Baho Yesu akavalongie vachulila vake, “Tulonge ikihumila mugati lyenu yeagehe na mganja vake, akamuhelelie mwilogati na kumlongela, ‘Mganja vangu, ndachime mibumunda midatu. <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />Kwakuva mganja vangu achumbile kwa nene akiva mumagendo, nene ndihela kyakulia kya kumgavila.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Mwene akiva mugati ngaamhigile, ‘Ubihile kunisumbula! Ndidindile mlyangilo. Nene na vana vangu tuvasile, sendivesa kulamka na kukugavila kinu kyokyonda!’ <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Ndakyene, ngita seilamuka na kumgavila mibumunda mganja vake, ila kwakuva munu seawene nyoni kuendelia kusuka, elamuka na kumgavila kila kyeakeliye. <verse eid="LUK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Kwa ndeni ndikuvalongela, sukeni na nyenye mwigavilwa, sakeni na nyenye mwipata, mkong'ole mulyangilo na nyenye mwidinduliwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Kwa munu yeyonda yeisuka hugavilwa, munu yeyonda yeisaka ipatila na munu yeyonda yeikong'ola mulyangilo udinduliwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Wuli, daada ani pagati lyenu damgavile mwana vake lyoka, ngita mwana vake amsukile somba? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Awu pemsuka likang'a, wuli, dakumgavila njemi? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Ngita nyenye vawofu, muchela kuvagavila vana venu finu finofu, ndakyene Daada venu va kuluhano dakuvagitila kuchumba ago, dakuvagavila Muhe va Nguluvi vala yevakumsuka!”<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Beelisebuli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Matayo 12.22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Maliko 3.20-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Kigono kimwinga Yesu akali akumuhecha munu lihoka yeamgitile munu kuva abihile kulonga. Yula lihoka peamuhumile, yula munu akavesile kulonga, hata lipinga lya vanu vakadudwive. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Ila vanu vangi vakalongie, “Akuvadaga mihoka kwa kugavilwa umwimike va mkomi va mahoka yeikemelwa Belisebuli.”<verse eid="LUK 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Vanu vangi vakamgechile vakasakile agite kimanyilo valole ngita idikilwe na Nguluvi. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Yesu akachela mahocho gawo, akavalongie, “Ung'achale vovonda veugavanike fipinga fipinga na kwitova uwene kwa uwene seuvesa kwikala hilo, kaye yeyonda yena ndewo, iyang'anika. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Ngita Setani akwipinga yumwene, ung'achale vake ukwima wuli? Ndilonga yendena, kwakuva nyenye mwilonga, nene ndikuvahecha mahoka kwa umwimike va ukomi va mahoka, mwene nde Belisebuli. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Suwe, ngita nene ndikuvadaga mahoka kwa umwimike va mkomi va mahoka yeakemelwa Belisebuli, wuli, hata vachulila venu va kuvadaga mahoka kwa umwimike vake? Ndeni, vene davakuvahiga nyenye. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Ila ikiva ndihecha lihoka kwa umwimike va Nguluvi, mchele kuva Ung'achale va Nguluvi ufikile kwa nyenye.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />“Munu munya ludali peidima kaye lyake kwa kyalukilo palidamo, finu fyake fyonda figehe pono lya lutengamaso. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Ila peachila munu munya ludali kuchumba mwene ekumdula na kumnyanga fyalukilo fyake fyonda fyeali akwidimila na kutegula finu fyake fyonda.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />“Munu yeyonda yeseisaka kuva pamwi na nene uyo ekunipinja na munu yeyonda yesenitanga kulundasa, uyo iyaganisa.”<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwuya kwa lihoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Matayo 12.43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />“Lihoka pelimuhumila munu, lichungutilachungutila isaka pono pe kwihela malenga, pono pakutulula. Seapatile pono pakutulula, akwilongela, ‘Ndiwuya mukaye lyangu pendihumile.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Peiwuya kangi uwilola yila kaye vafyagie na valembiche. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Suwe ihelela na kuvategula mahoka vangi saba vahafu kuchumba mwene, vonda huelela na kumwingila munu uyo. Na wumi va munu uyo ivecha wofu hilo kuchumba pamwandi.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukeduko lwa undakyene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Yesu peakali ilonga ago, mdala yumwi mulila lipinga lya vanu, akalonga kwa lichwi, “Afunyilwe mdala yeakubabile na kukuong'elecha!”<verse eid="LUK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Yesu akamuhigile, “Ila vafunyilwe hilo vala yevapulika luchowo lwa Nguluvi na kulidikila.”<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vanu vakela kimanyilo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Matayo 12.38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Lipinga lya vanu peuginile kwongeleka, Yesu akavalongie, “Kilelo iki ndi kilelo kyekigehe na sambi, kisaka kimanyilo, sekigavilwa kimanyilo kyokyonda seivechile kila kimanyilo kya Yona. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Ngita Yona peakali kimanyilo kwa vanu va Ninawi, ndifyo Mwana va Munu ivesa kimanyilo kwa kilelo iki. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Mukigono kya kuhiga, mtavala mkomi mdala va Sheba daikwima na kuvawonesa kuva kilelo iki ndi kihofu, kwakuva mwene ahegile muinyi lyake. Akahele kupulika njowo cha uginyange lwa ng'achale Solomoni na baha ndigehe mkomi kuchumba ng'achale Solomoni. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Mukigono kya kuhiga, vanu va Ninawi vakwima na kuwonesa kuva kilelo iki kihofu, kwakuva vavo vakahongiche pevapulikile madaliko gya Yona. Ndakyene ndikuvalongela nene ndigehe baha mkomi kuchumba Yona.<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Welu va mvili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Matayo 5.15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6.22-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />“Kwihela munu yeiwesa kwasa kibatali na kuifiya awu kuigubika na kiviya, ila kuivika pakyanya lya kisusu neke vanu yevakwingila mugati vawese kulola welu. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Meho gyako nde kibatali lya mvili vako. Ngita meho gyako gilola unofu, mvili vako vonda dauvecha muwelu. Ngita meho gyako segilola, filafila mvili vako vonda dauvecha mukisi. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Suwe wilolele, welu weugehe mugati lyako ubihile kuseduka kuva kisi. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Ngita mvili vako vonda umemile welu na kuhela pono pepagehe na kisi, mvili ugo daung'ala hilo ngita kibatali kyekikulangachila kwa welu lwake.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvachogomicha Vafalisayo na Vawulanichi va Malagicho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matayo 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maliko 12.38-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Yesu peamalile kulonga, Mfalisayo yumwi akamlalika kulia kyakula kukaye lyake. Yesu akahele, akakalile panyi kuliya kyakula. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Mfalisayo uyo akadudwive peamuwonile Yesu eliya kyakula bila kukalava mawoko gyake ngita pevigita kila kigono. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Mtwa akamlongie, “Nyenye Vafalisayo mwiwofoga fikombe na sahani kwivala, ila mugati mumemile ndewo na uwofu. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Vapufi nyenye! Wuli Nguluvi yeagelaniche kwivala, ndiyulayula yeagelaniche mugati? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Muvagavile vahangala finu fyemnafyo na kila kinu kyemugita dakikumkelisa Nguluvi.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />“Ila damukikilava nyenye Mafalisayo! Kwakuva mukumuhechela Nguluvi pono lya chumi, mahamba ga mgunda mdodo ngita file nyasafu na fiwungo fya kuwungila kyakulia mafweme na mapambalambuwa, ila uguvachanga vanu na semukumkela Nguluvi. Mwitakilwa tandi muveche vanu vasanzi na vevamkela Nguluvi bila kugaleka ago gangi.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />“Damwilava nyenye Mafalisayo! Kwakuva mwikela kukala figoda fya pautalo mukaye lya kutang'anila Vayawudi pono pa uginyange na kuhungilwa kwa uginyange musoko. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Damwilava nyenye Mafalisayo, kwakuva mwiwana ngita miugono gegayagile na vanu vachumba kukyanya lyake kuno sevachela.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Yumwi va vawulanichi va Malagicho akamlongie, “Muwulanichi, njowo chako chikutuliga na nefwe filafila.”<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yesu akamuhigile, “Damwilava nyenye Vawulanichi va malagicho! Mkuvatwika vanu michigo mikomi, kuno nyenye semwikolela hata kwa kyala kimwi kuvatanga. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Damwilava nyenye! Kwakuva nyenye mukuvachengela muugono, vavichi va Nguluvi vevadochilwe na vagogolo venu. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Nyenye vavene nde vaswida na mwikwidikila gala gyevagitile vagogolo venu. Vavo vavadochile vavichi va Nguluvi na nyenye mwichenga migunda gya Nguluvi gyawo. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Ifyo, Nguluvi alongile muuginyage vake endee, ‘Ndikuvalagicha vavichi va Nguluvi na vanjagila, ila vamonga vadochwa na vangi vagudwa.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Ifyo kilelo iki dakihigwa, kwa kuvadocha vavichi va Nguluvi vonda kuhuma inyi peiwumbilwe, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />kuhuma kudochwa kwa Abeli mbaka kudochwa kwa Sakalia yula yeadochilwe mukaye Nguluvi pautalo lya kindangavala kya kunyanya na pono pang'alili. Ena, ndakyene kilelo iki dakihigwa kwa kuvadocha havo vonda.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />“Damwilava nyenye vawulanichi va Malagicho! Kwakuva muhufihile udindulo lwa mulyangilo lya kumchela Nguluvi, nyenye vavene semukwingile na muvakanile vanu vala vevakali kukwingila!”<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Yesu peakali ihumile pala, vala Mafalisayo na vawulanichi va Malagicho vavangile kumkekeneka na kumsokosa kwa kumuwucha mahucho gyolofu, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />neke vambate kwa kinu kyokyonda kyeilonga.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akuulakilila ufyangu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Matayo 10.26-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Lipinga likomi hilo lya vanu likatang'ane, mbaka vanu vakali vakwivatila Yesu akavangile kuywanga na vachulila vake, “Mwilolele na lisimika lya Mafalisayo gya ufyangu. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Chochonda chekigubikilwe kigubutuliwa na kyekifihile kiwoneka pawelu pee. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Ifyo, kyokyonda kyemlongile mukisi vanu vakugapulika pawelu pee na kila kyempwepwe kwa lupwepo pakituvili, kuno milyangilo gidindilwe, gilanduchwa kwivala lya kaye.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ani tumwogofye</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Matayo 10.28-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />“Ndikuvalongela nyenye vamganja vangu, mbihile kuvawogofya vala vevidocha muvili, ila sevavesile kugita kinu kyokyonda kihofu. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Dandikuvawonesa yula vakumwogofya. Mumkogofye Nguluvi mwene umwimika, peimalila kudocha iwesa kumtaga munu mulyoto seuchimika mbepali. Ndakyene, mumwogwipe uyo.<verse eid="LUK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />“Mwichela kuva shewele vahanu huguchwa kwa sendi ndodo hela? Ila kwihela hata yeisemwa na Nguluvi. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Hata fwili cha mituwe yenu chivalilwe chonda. Mbihile kogofya, nyenye ngiba hilo kuchumba shewele volofu!<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumdikila awu kumlema Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Matayo 10.32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12.32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10.19-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />“Ndikuvalongela ndakyene, munu yeyonda yeidikila pavanu kuva mwene va nene, Mwana va Munu akumwidikila pautalo lya vandumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Ila munu yeyonda yakunilema pautalo pa vanu na Mwana va Munu ekumlema pautalo lya vandumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi.<verse eid="LUK 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />“Munu yeyonda yeikumlonga uwofu Mwana va Munu, Nguluvi akumuwonela lusungu, ila munu yeyonda yeakumliga Muhe va Nguluvi seilekelwa sambi.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />“Pevakuvanyamua na kuvasindika kuvavalata nyenye pautalo pa kaye lya kutang'anila Vayawudi na pautalo pa vatavala na vakomi vene umwimike, mbihile kogofya kyakulonga na kyakuhiga. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Kwakuva Muhe va Nguluvi ekuvawulanicha kila kyemung'ang'wa kulonga.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufano va mmosi mpufi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Suwe, munu yumwi mulila lipinga lya vanu akamlongie Yesu, “Muwulanichi, mlongele lukololo vangu tugavane uhala weatulekile daada vetu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yesu akamuhigile, “Wuli mganja nde ani yeanivikile nene kuvalamulila awu kuvagavila uhala venu?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Suwe avalongie vonda, “Mwilolele na ng'efu cha finu, kwakuva wumi va munu sehumila na wolofu va finu feunafyo.”<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Baho, akavalongie mufano ugu, “Kukali na mmosi yumwi yeakali na mgunda lyelibabile mabenelo myolofu. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Mmosi uyo ahochile munumbula lyake, ‘Ndihela lusanja. Nonde ndigite liki?’ <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Baho akwilongela, ‘Nditunyula lusanja lyangu na kuchenga lingi likomi hilo, mumo ndivika mpunga vangu vonda na finu fyangu fyonda.’ <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Baho ndikwilongela munumbula lyangu, ‘Veve numbula lyangu! Nonde ugehe na finu fyolofu fya kutumila kwa myaka gyolofu. Tulule na uliye na unyuwe na ukeduke!’ <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Ila Nguluvi akamlongie, ‘Veve mpufi! Neng'uli pamie ndikela numbula lyako. Na finu fila fyonda fyeuyivikile fivecha fya ani?’”<verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Yesu amalile kwa kulonga, “Endeni ivecha kwa munu yeyonda yeajivikile umosi yumwene, ila seajivikie umosi kwa Nguluvi.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumuhuvila Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Matayo 6.25-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Baho Yesu akavalongie vachulila vake, “Mbihile kuguda kwa kyakuliya kyemwisaka neke muveche wumi awu myenda mweisaka kwa mivili gyenu. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Kwakuva wumi nde ngiba hilo kuchumba kyakuliya na mvili nde ngiba kuchumba myenda. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Muvalole kungulu, sevivyala vala kubena vala vehela lusanja, ila Nguluvi ekuvalisa. Wuli Nguluvi sevakuvakela nyenye kuchumba fidege? <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Nde ani pagati lyenu yeiwesa kwiguda na iwesa kwiwongelesela lisaa limwi mu wumi vake? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Ngita semwiwesa kugita njowo ndodo ngita ilyi, wuli ukugagudila ago gangi? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Mlole uluva pegimela. Segigita kasi vala segibota. Ila ndikuvalongea, ata ng'achale Solomoni na ukomi vake vonda seawesile kufwala unofu ngita limwi mugati lya uluva aga. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Ngita Nguluvi hulifwalisa ilyo likwati lya mugunda na neng'uli ligehe na kilawu litagwa mulyoto, wuli seivesa kuvagitila njowo gyolofu? Nyenye vanu yemunya mbatwa ndodo!<verse eid="LUK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />“Suwe, mbihile kuhocha kuva mwiliya liki awu munyuwa liki. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Vanu sevakumchela Nguluvi vigudila finu ifyo. Ila nyenye, Daada venu va kuluhano ichela finu fyemwisaka. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Mugudikile tandi Ung'achale va Nguluvi na finu ifyo mugavilwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umosi kuluhano kwa Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Matayo 6.19-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />“Mbihile kwogofya, nyenye lipinga lidodo, kwakuva Daada venu va kuluhano ekela kuvagavila Ung'achale. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Muguche umosi venu, mukavagavile vahangala icho sendi. Kuno nde kwivikila akiba mukihondo kyako kuluhano, ukoya seiupwemka, ukoya kuhela muhichi yeivesa kuhicha na kuhela umehe weuwesa kuuwanang'a. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Pala peigehe umosi vako, ndipo yeuvecha numbula lyako.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vanyigendwa muveche meho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />“Mwiyandalise kunigumbanikila na kibatali chenu chive chikwaka, <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />muve ngita vachulila yevakumchindila mtwa vawo awuye kuhuma mulihungu lya kutola. Peiwuya na kukong'ola mlyangilolo bahobaho ekumdindulila. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Vafunyilwe vala vachulila ambavo mtwa vawo peiwuya akuvalola vakalile meho! Ndikuvalongela ndakyene, mwene mkomi uyu akwiyandalisa na kuvalongela vakale panyi na kuvagundamikila. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Vafunyilwe vachulila vala mtwa vao dapevalola vakalile meho na kudima ata ngita peiwuya mwilogati. <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Mucheleni kuva, ngita munya kaye achela saa lya mwichi peikwacha, angekala meho, vala seangeileka kaye lyake idenywe. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Filafila nyenye mujitayalise, kwakuva Mwana va Munu ekwacha saa yesemuchela.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mchulila yeidikilwa na yeseidikilwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Matayo 24.45-51</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Peteli akamuhuchile, “Mtwa, wuli ukutulongela nefwe weka hela mufano ulu awu ukuvalongela vanu vonda?”<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Mtwa akamhigile, “Wuli mchulila ani yeidikilwa na munya uginyange? Mchulila yula ambalye mtwa vake yemvikile kuvatavala vachulila vangi na kuvagavila kyakula vakati unofu? <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Afunyilwe mchulila yula mtwa vake peiwuya ekumuwona egita endena. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Ndakyene ndikuvalongela mkomi uyo ekumvika mchulila yula atavale finu fyake fyonda. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Ila ngita mchulila uyo peikwilongela mu numbula lyake, ‘Mtwa vangu acheliwe kuwuya’ na kuvanga kuvatova vachulila vayage vagosi awu vadala na mwene filafila iliya na inyuwa mbaka kugala. <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />Suwe, mtwa va mchulila uyo ikwacha mukigono kyeseakichela na saa yeseailolele. Mkomi uyo akumdunula fipande fipande na kumvika pamwi na vanu yesevidikile.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />“Mchulila yeachela gala gyeikela mkomi vake gyeagite, ila sekwitayalisa vala seigita gyeakelwa mtwa vake, mchulila uyo itovwa hilo. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Ila mchulia yula seichela gyeikela mkomi vake na mwene igita uhofu, mchulila uyo itovwa kidodo, munu yeyonda yeagavilwe fyolofu kwamwene fitakilwa fyolofu. Munu yeyonda yeagavilwe na mkomi vake kasi ngomi munu uyo ihomba hilo.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvanenganicha vanu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Matayo 10.34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />“Ndachile kwasa lyoto muinyi na ndikela ungevecha uwasilwe! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Ndinago ubatiso gending'ang'wa kugaanuka, nene ndiguda hilo mbaka kumwiso! <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Wuli mwihocha ndachile kuleta ulutengamaso muinyi? Hamu! Sendachile kuvagita vanu vikale kwa ulutengamaso bali kuvanenga vanu. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Nakuvangila nonde, vanu vahanu vevakali mukaye yimwi vakwitova, vadatu kwa vavili na vavili kwa vadatu. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Daada akwitova na mwana mgosi vake na mwana mgosi vake akwitova na daada vawo na maye akwitova na muhinja vake na muhinja akwitova na maye vake. Mganafu akwitova na mkamwana vake na mkamwana akwitova na mganafu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuchela fipindi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Matayo 16.2-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yesu akagalongie kangi mapinga gya vanu, “Pemulola lifunde gihuma lubali pelidibala lichuwa, baho mwilonga, ndonya itonya, ndakyene ndonya daitonya. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Pemulola lukala kuhuma lubali lya kusini wipuga, mwilonga kwivecha na lyoto na ndeni daivecha. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Nyenye vafyangu! Wichela kulagula kwa kulola inyi na kululanga na kulonga ndonya daitonya awu ndonya seitonya awu lichuwa lihuma awu lichuwa selihuma. Wuli semuwesa kuchela njowo chechigitwa nonde?<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Njengakaya na mchindwama vako</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Matayo 5.25-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />“Wuli semwiwesa kwilamulila vavene kuva vasanzi? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Ngita munu akukusindika kuutengule ndeunofu mnjengekaye mkiva mwave mung'asi, ngaabihile kukusindika kwa muhiga na mwene ekukusindika kwa mpuga na mwene akukuvika mukiwopo. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Ndikukulongela ndakyene sewihega ukoya, mbaka kuhecha sendi cha kusinda.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Kumuwuyila Nguluvi awu kufuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Vakati ugougo kukali na vanu yevamlongie Yesu njowo cha vanu va ku Galilaya yevadochilwe na Pilato na danda lya vanu havo ikahang'anikana na usembe yevakali vekumuhechela Nguluvi. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yesu akavahigile, “Mwihocha kuva vanu va ku Galilaya yevagitilwe endena kwakuva vakali na sambi kuvagina vanu va ku Galilaya vangi vonda? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Hamu, ndakyene ndikuvalongela, ngita semwileka sambi na nyenye mwidochwa ngita vawo. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Wuli vala vanu chumi na vanane yevafue kwa kugwiliwa na lilingo ukoya Siloamu, ndeni mwihocha vawo vakali na sambi kuchumba vangi vonda yevakalile ku Yelusalemu? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Hamu, ndakyene ndikuvalongela, ngita semwileka sambi na kumuwuyila Nguluvi na nyenye mwidochwa ngita vawo.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufano va libiki lyeselibaba manunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Baho Yesu akavalongile mufano ugu, “Munu yumwi akavyalile libiki lya likuyu mumgunda vake va masabibu. Akahelela kusaka linunu mulibiki ilyo, ila sealipatile. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Baho, munu yula akamlongie mnyigendwa va mgunda ugo, ‘Lole kwa myaka midatu ndikali ndikwacha kunokola manunu ga libiki ilyi na nene sendipatile hata limwi. Udumule! Wuli uwendelise kuhananga muhanga?’ <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Ila mnyigendwa va mgunda ugo, akamlongie, ‘Mtwa, tuuleke kangi mwaka ugu, ndikuutufulila mganga na kuvika mboleya. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Ngita daubaba manunu ivecha unofu, ila ngita seubaba daudumula.’”<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ekumnanicha mdala Kigono kya Kutulula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Mu Kigono kya Kutulula, Yesu akali iwulanicha mukaye lya kutang'anila Vayawudi. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Baho pakali na mdala, akali na lihoka lyelimgitile atamike kwa miyaka chumi na nane, lihoka ilyo likamgitile agogombile sewesile kwigolola. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Yesu peamuwene, akamkemela na akamlongie, “Maye, unanichwe utamwa vako.” <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Baho Yesu akamvikile liwoko mdala yula bahobaho akagolwike na akavanga kumnjuma Nguluvi.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Ila mkomi va kaye lya kutang'anila Vayawudi akavipile kwakuva Yesu akali amnaniche mdala yula mu Kigono kya Kutulula. Ifyo akavalongie vala vanu yevalundine bahala, “Mugehe na figono sita fya kugita kasi. Ifyo mwache mufigono ifyo mnanichwe utamwa venu, ila mbihile kwacha mu Kigono kya Kutulila.”<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Baho Mtwa akamuhigile, “Nyenye vafyangu! Ani pagati lyenu yeakumuwopola senga vake awu lipunda lyake kuhuma mukivingilili mu Kigono kya Kutulula na kumlongocha kunyuwa malenga? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Muhinja uyu ndi ulelo va Ibulahimu, yeabatilwe na Setani kwa myaka chumi na nane. Wuli, seunofu kumdindula ndegei cha kyuma Mukigono kya Kutulula?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Yesu pealongile ndeni, vachundamwa vakawene nyoni, ila vanu vakaendelia kukeduka kwa njowo chinofu cheagitile Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufano va mbeyu ndodo yeikemelwa haladali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Matayo 13.31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maliko 4.30-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Baho Yesu akavahucha, “Wuli Ung'achale va Nguluvi uwana na liki? Wuli ndiuwananise na liki? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Iwana na kimbeyu kadodo yeikemelwa haladali yeanyamule munu yumwi na kuivyala kumgunda vake na mbeyu yila ikamelile na kuvecha libiki na fidege vachengile fyaso fyawo pamakwati gyake.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufanu lya lisimika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:33">Matayo 13.33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Yesu akavahuchile kangi, “Wuli ndikuuwanisa Ung'achale va Nguluvi na liki? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Uwana na lisimika yeainyamue mdala yumwi na kuihanganya pamwi na utine va madebe gadatu mbaka utine vonda utupile.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlyangilo mdodo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:13">Matayo 7.13</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:14">14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Baho Yesu endelie na lugendo lyake kuhelela ku Yelusalemu. Peakali mung'asi, akachumbile mumwani na mufijijini, akiwulanicha vanu. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Munu yumwi akamuhuchile Yesu, “Wuli, Mtwa davakombolewa vadodo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Yesu akamuhigile, <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />“Mukangale kwingila mugati kwa kuchumbila mlyangilo mdodo, kwakuva vanu volofu vesaka kwingila ila seviwesa. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Vakati ukwacha, munu munya kaye ekwima na kudinda mlyangilo. Na nyenye mwikwima pevala na kuvanga kukong'ola mlyangilo pemulonga, ‘Mtwa, tudinduliye mulyangilo.’ Ila mwene akuvahiga, ‘Sendichela kwemuhumile.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Baho mukumuhiga, ‘Tukaliye na kunyuwa pamwinga na veve, ukatuwulaniche mufijiji fyetu.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Ila mwene akuvahiga kangi, ‘Sendichela kwemuhumile. Muhege baha nyenye vonda vawofu.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Damwivemba na kusigina mino, pemukumuwona Ibulahimu, Isaka na Yakobo na vavichi va Nguluvi vonda vagehe mu Ung'achale va Nguluvi, ila nyenye mwitagwa kwivala! <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Vanu vekwacha kuhuma lubali chonda cha inyi lubali lwa kuhumila lichuwa na lubali lwa kudibala lichuwa, kuhuma lubali lwa kukyanya na lubali lwa kwivindi na vakwekala mulihungu vekiliya mu Ung'achale va Nguluvi. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Baho, vanu vevakali kumwiso davavecha va kwanja, va kwanja vakali Vayawudi ila vakamkanile Yesu. Na vamwiso vakali vanu vevakali se Vayawudi vakamdikie Yesu na va kwanja davavecha vakumwiso.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuuvembela Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Matayo 23.37-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Figono fifila, vamonga va Mafalisayo vakamuhelelie Yesu vakamlongie, “Hege baha uhele pono pangi, kwakuva Helode esaka kukudocha.”<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yesu akavahigile, “Muhelele mkamlongele mwene likeve ende, ‘Neng'uli na kilawu ndidaga mihoka na kunanicha vatamwa, mukigono kya udatu ndimalila kasi lyagu.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Hata ifyo, neng'uli na kilawu na pauke, ndiendelela na lugendo lwangu, kwakuva seunofu mvichi adochwe kwivala lya ku Yelusalemu.<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />“Nyenye vanu va ku Yelusalemu! Nyenye vanu va ku Yelusalemu! Mukuvadocha vavichi va Nguluvi na kuvatova maganga vala vananzi yevalagichwe kwaveve! Mala chilinga ndesakile kuvalundasa vana vako pamwinga ngita ng'uku peigubika twana twake kwa mapatilo gake, ila nyenye semukelie! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Mulole mulekilwe kaye lyenu lya Nguluvi. Ndikuvalongela semukunilola mbaka mulonge, afunyilwe yula yeikwacha kwa litawa lya Mtwa.”<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ekumunanicha munu mtamwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Mu kigono kya Kutulula, Yesu akahele kuliya kyakulia mukaye lya mkomi yumwi va Vafalisayo na vanu yevagehe pala vakali vekumulolela hilo valole kila kyedaakigita. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Munu yumwi yeikali na utamwa va kutupa mvili vonda akahele kwa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yesu akavahuchile vawulanichi va Malagicho na Vafalisayo, “Wuli, malagicho gya Musa chikutuidika kumunanicha munu mu Kigono kya Kutulula awu chikanicha?”<verse eid="LUK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Ila vene vachikile chii. Yesu akamkolela yula mtamwa, akamnaniche, akamlekile ahele kukaye lyake. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Baho Yesu akavalongela, “Ani yumwi venu yeali na mwana vake awu senga vake yeadumbukile mulilindi mu Kigono kya Kutulula, wuli, seawesila kumuhecha kwivala?”<verse eid="LUK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Ila vanu avo sevawesile kumuhiga.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulema ukomi na kuvawanuka vagenji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Yesu akavawene vala vevalalikwe pevihagula figoda fya utalo pono pa uginyange, akavalongela mufano ulu, <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />“Ngita munu akulalike mulihungu lya kutola, ubihile kwikala figoda fya utalo pono pa uginyange. Kwakuva iwesekana alalikilwe munu yungi munya uginyange kuchumba veve, <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />na munu yeavalalike vanu vonda ekwacha na kukulongela, ‘Mlekele uyu kigoda.’ Baho wiwona nyoni pautalo pa vanu vonda na kuhelela kukala kigoda kya kumbele. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Ila peulalikwa mulihungu wikale kigoda kya kumbele, neke yeakulalika peikwacha akulongele, ‘Mganja, wache ukale baha pautalo,’ Baho uvecha mkomi na vanu vonda yevakalile pamwi nave. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Kwakuva munu yeyonda yeakwigita mkomi igitwa mdodo na akwigita mdodo igitwa mkomi.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Baho Yesu akamlongie na yula yeamulalike, “Ngita ukuvaandalila vanu kyakulia kya pamunyi awu palumie, ubihile kuvalalika vaganja vako awu vakolo vako awu vapepi vako na vevagehe vamosi. Ngita ukugita endena, navo vakukulalika na veve ukava uwombilwe kila kyeuvagitile. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Ila peugita lihungu valalike na vahangala na vatenda na fiwete na vevabofwike meho, <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />na veve ufunywa, kwakuva havo vahela kya kukuhomba. Nguluvi akukuhomba mukigono kya uchulubuko va vanu vasanzi.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufanu va lihungu likomi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Matayo 22.1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Yumwi va vala yevali vekalile pamwi na Yesu peapulike ifi, akamlongie Yesu, “Afunyilwe munu yula yeiliya kyakula kya lihungu mu Ung'achale va Nguluvi.”<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yesu akamuhigile, “Munu yumwi agitile lihungu likomi, akavalike vanu volofu. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Kigono kya lihungu peufikila, akamlagiliche mchulila vake akavalongie, vevalalikwe, ‘Mwache finu fyonda figehe suwe.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Ila vonda, vavangile kumuhongicha. Vakwanja akamlongie mchulila, ‘Ndigulile mgunda ndihelela kugulola, sendivesa kwacha.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Munu yungi akalagule, ‘Ndigulile senga kumi va kugima, nonde ndigehe mung'asi kuhelela kuvagelecha kugima, sendiwesa kwacha.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Munu yungi akalongile, ‘Nonde nditola sendiwesa kwacha.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Muchulila yula akawuyile na kumlongela mtwa vake njowo chila. Yula mwene kaye akavipile, akamlongie mchulila vake, ‘Helele kisatu mufitongoji na fimwani na uvaletile baha vahangala na munu munyalugaso na vevabofwike meho na vatenda.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Mchulila yula akamlongie, ‘Mtwa, gala gyeunilagiliche ndigitile, ila nafwasi lya kwikala vanu yave igehe.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Yula mtwa akamlongie mchulila, ‘Helele mung'asi na mufijiji na valongile vanu vache neke kaye lyangu imeme. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Ndakyene ndikuvalongela, kwihela hata yumwi pagati lya vala yendivalalike daigecha kyakula kya lihungu lyangu!’”<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kugudika kuvecha mchulila va Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Matayo 10.37-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Baho lipinga likomi lya vanu likali ligenda pamwi na Yesu, akavasedukile na kuvalongela, <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />Munu yeyonda yeikwacha kwa nene, ngita seakumkela daada vake na maye vake na mdala vake na vana na vahacha vake na sekwikela wumi vake seiwesa kuvecha mchulila vangu. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Munu yeyonda yeseitegula kipindilihicho lwake na kunifwatila nene seivesa kuva mchulila vangu. <verse eid="LUK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Mchindile ndivalongele, ndi ani pagati lyenu yeisaka kuchenga lilingo sekwikala tandi avalile, anacho sendi chilinga cha kusindilichila kuchenga limnala? <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Ngita daseigita ifyo evesa kuchenga musingi hela na kulemuwa kumalila kuchenga limnala ugo, vanu vonda vevikumlola kyeagitile vakumuheka. <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />Vakilonga, munu uyu avangile kuchenga ila seavesile kumalila kasi. <verse eid="LUK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Awu ndi ng'achale ani peisaka kuhelela kwitova na ng'achale yungi na seiwesa kwikala tandi na kuhocha ngita iwesa, kuhelela kwitova na munya vapuga elufu isilini na mwene anavo vapuga elufu kumi? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Ngita elola seiwesa, ekuvalagicha vananzi vake kwa ng'achale yula ikiva have kutali amsuke vavike upataniso lya utengamaso. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Ifyo ifyo, kwihela munu yeyonda pagati yenu daiwesa kuva mchulila vangu ngita daabihile kuleka fyonda fyeagehe nafyo.<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munyo weuanang'ike</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:13">Matayo 5.13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maliko 9.50</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />“Munyo ndi nofu, ila ikiyaga unofu vake, wigita wuli neke ikole kangi? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Senofu kuvika mumhanga va kuhanganya na mboleya, vanu huitaga patali. Munya masigicha gya kupulika na apulike!”<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Mufano va kondolo yeayagile</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Matayo 18.12-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Kigono kimwi vanyamula usulu na venye sambi volofu vakahele kumpulikicha Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Vafalisayo na vawulanichi va Malagicho vavangile kuhenima, “Mulole munu uyu, akuvapokela vanu venye sambi na kuliya navo!” <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Baho Yesu akavahigile kwa mufano akilonga.<verse eid="LUK 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />“Ngita yumwi venu akiva na ng'ondolo miya, akichela kuva yumwi ayagile, igita liki? Akuvaleka vala tisini na tisa mudasi na kuhelela kumsaka yula yeayagile mbaka ampatile. <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Peakumuwona, ekeduka na kumvika mumavega gyake, <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />na kumsindika kukaye. Baho akuvakemela vaganja vake na vapepi na kuvalongea, ‘Mukeduke pamwi na nene, kwakuva nimuwonile yula ng'ondolo vangu yeayagile.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Ifyo ifyo ndikuvalongela kuvecha na lukeduko ngomi kuluhano kwa Nguluvi, kwa munu yumwi munya sambi kuhongecha sambi chake, kuchumba vanu tisini na tisa yevikwilolela kuva vasanzi, yesevisaka kuhongecha.<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sendi yeiyagile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />“Yesu akavalongie mufano wungi akalongie, tulonge mdala yumwi agehe na sendi kumi na sendi yimwi iyagile, igita liki? Ikwasa kibatali, afyagila kaye na kuisaka kwa unofu kila pono mbaka aiwene. <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Peakuipata, ekuvakemela vaganja na vapepi vake na kuvalongela, ‘Mukeduke pamwi na nene, kwakuva ndiiwene sendi lyangu yeiyagilege.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Ndeni ndeni, ndikuvalongela kugehe na lukeduko patalo lya vandumindumi va kuluhanu kwa Nguluvi kwa munu yumwi kuhongecha sambi chake.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufano va mwana yeayagile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yesu akaendelie kulonga, “Kukali na munu yumwi munya vana vavili vagosi. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Yula mdodo akamlongile daada vake, ‘Daada, ndigavile pono pangu pa uhala vangu.’ Nave akavagavila pono pake pa uhala vake. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Pefichumbile figono fidodo, yula mdodo akaguchile mafwani vake, baho akahegile kukaye, akahelela mu inyi lya kutali, ukoya akachiyagiling'acha kwa njowo wofu. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Peamalile kutumila kila kinu, kukahumile lumyayo mu inyi yila yonda na mwene akali ihela kinu kyokyonda. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Asukile kasi kwa munu yumwi va inyi yila na mwene akamsindike kumgunda vake kuvagavila kyakula vangubi. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Mdimi yula akali na njala hilo, akadobokile kuliya mikona geviliya vala vangubi, ila kukali kwihela munu yeyonda yeamgavile kinu. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Pambele akahochile munumbula lyake akalongile, ‘Mbona kuna vanyigendwa volofu kwa daada vangu veviliya na kufileka, kuno nene ndifuwa njala? <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Ndiwuya kwa daada vangu na kumlongela, “Daada, ndigitile sambi kwa Nguluvi na ndikukosie na veve daada vangu. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Sendidikilwa kukemwelwa mwana vako, unigite ngita yumwi va vanyigendwa vako.”’ <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Suwe akavangile lugendo lwa kuwuya kwa daada vake.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">“Peagehe have kutali, daada vake akamuwonela lusungu, akamnyilie mwana vake, akamkumbatila kwa lukelo. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Mwana vake akamlongie, ‘Daada, ndigitile sambi kwa Nguluvi na ndikukosie na veve daada vangu. Sendidikilwa hata kukemelwa mwana vako.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Ila daada vake akavakemela vachulila vake, akavalongela, ‘Kisatu! Mulete lihingila linofu mumufwalise. Na mfise pete mukyala na makobasi mumagulu gyake! <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Mumuhinje senga yeanonile, tugite lihungu na kukeduka! <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Kwakuva uyu mwana vangu, akali ngita afuwe, nonde nde uwumi, akali ayagile na nonde awonike.’ Navo vavangile kugita lihungu.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />“Luhungu pelikali likwendelela mwana vake mkomi akali have kumgunda. Peakali ewuya pepi na kufikila pakaye, akapulike vanu vesomola na kukina. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Akamkemela yumwi va vachulila, akamuhucha, ‘Kuna liki baha?’ <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Yula mnyigendwa akamuhigile, ‘Lukolo vako awuyile kukaye, daada vako amuhinjile senga yeanonile kwakuva awuyile akiva mumi.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Uyo mdimi mkomi akavipile akalema kwingila mukaye lyao. Baho daada vake akahumile kwivala na kumsuka aingile mugati. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Mdimi yula akamuhigile daada vake, ‘Lole! Myaka gyonda igi ndikugundamikie na hata kigono kimwi sendilekile kuginya malagicho gyako. Unigavile liki? Seunigavile hata mene yumwi ndikagite lihungu pamwi na vaganja vangu! <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Ila mwana vako uyu ayaganiche uhala vake pamwi na vagoni, peawuyile hela, umuhinjile senga yeanonile.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Daada vake akamuhigile, ‘Mwana vangu, veve ugehe pamwi na nene figono fyonda, finu fyonda fyendinafyo ndi fyako. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Ila tutakilwe tugite lihungu na kukeduka, kwakuva uyo lukolo vako akali ngita afuwe, nonde agehe mumi, akali ayagile, ila nonde awonikile.’”<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Muhimilicha yesedikilwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yesu avalongie vachulila vake, kukali na mmosi yumwi yeakali na muhimilicha va finu fyake. Mmosi uyu akapulike kuva muhimilicha va finu fyake, ekuyaganicha sendi cha mtwa vake, <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />ndeni, kamkemela mugati akamuhucha, ndi njowo liki chendipulika kwa veve? Ndivalile finu fyonda fyeuwanuke na fyeuhechile, kwakuva seuvesa kangi kuvecha muhimilicha va finu fyangu. <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Yula muhimilicha akahochile munumbula lyake, Mtwa vangu ekunidaga mukasi lyangu. Ndigita liki? Kuhelela kugima sendiwesa, kuhelela kusuka ndiwona nyoni. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Ndakyene, ndichela kya kugita, neke pendidagwa mukasi lyangu, vanu vanihanuke mukaye chawo. <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />“Ndeni yula muhimilicha akavakemele vanu vonda yevakali vidailwa na mkomi vake. Akamuhuchile yealonguwe kwanja, ‘Wuli, widailwa liki na mtwa vangu?’ <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Mwene akamuhigile, ‘Mapipa miya gya mafuta ga miseituni.’ Yula muhimilicha akamlongie, ‘Tegule kiganulo kyako kya deni na wusimbe mapipa hamusini.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Akamuhucha yeidailwa yungi, ‘Na veve widailwa liki?’ Akamuhigile, ‘Maloboto miya gya mpunga.’ Yula muhimilicha akamlongie, ‘Tegule kiganulo kyako kya deni na wusimbe maloboto semanini.’<verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />“Suwe, yula mtwa akamnjuma yula muhimilicha yesedikilwa, kwakuva agitile kinu kwa luhala. Kwakuva vanu vawofu va inyi sevakumdikila Nguluvi vigita kasi chawo kwa luhala kugina vala vanu vevakumdikila Nguluvi.” <verse eid="LUK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Yesu akaendelie kulonga, “Nene ndikuvalongela, muvatange vaganja venu kwa mali chenu chiwofu cha baha muinyi, neke pechisila, muwanukwe na vandumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi mbepali. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Munu yeyonda yeagehe mwidikilwa munjowo ndodo, ivecha mwidikiiwa munjowo ngomi, yeyonda yeibihila kwidikila njowo ndodo, seivecha mwidikilwa munjowo ngomi. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Ngita nyenye sevadikila kuvika mali cha inyi, ndi ani yeakuvagavila mali cha undakyene? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Ngita nyenye sevadikila mumali lya munu yungi, ndi ani yeakuvagavila mali chenu nyenye vavene?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />“Kwihela mnyigendwa yeiwesa kuvagundamikila vatwa vavili, kwakuva daakumvipila yumwi na kumkela yungi, awu kwiwunga na yungi na kumubeda yungi. Semwiwesa kumgumbanikila Nguluvi na sendi.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Njowo chingi cha Yesu.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:12">Matayo 11.12</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 11:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31">5.31</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 5:32">32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11">Maliko 10.11</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:12">12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Kwa fila Mafalisayo vakali vikela sendi, pevapulike ago, vakambeda Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Yesu akavalongie, “Nyenye mwikwigita vasanzi pautalo lya vanu, ila Nguluvi akuchichela numbula chenu. Kwakuva kinu kyekiwoneka kya unginyange, ila Nguluvi akugavipila.”<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />“Malagicho gya Musa na masimbo gya vavichi va Nguluvi gakali gekuvalongocha mbaka chipindi cha Yohani Mbatisa. Kuhuma vakati ugo, njowo cha Ung'achale va Nguluvi chadalikilwe na kila vanu viswitilichwa kwingila mu Ung'achale va Nguluvi. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Ila ndi upefu hilo luhano na inyi kuyaganika, kuchumba kuhechwa helufi ndodo mumalagicho.”<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />“Munu yeyonda yeakumleka mdala vake na kumtola yungi igita ugoni na munu yeakumtola mdala yealekilwe igita ugoni.”<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munu mmosi na Lasalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />“Yesu akaendelie kuywanga, pakali na munu yumwi mmosi, akali ifwala myenda gya sendi ngomi hilo na akali akwikala maisa gya kwikedusa mwene.” <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Pamulyangilo mkomi pa yula mmosi akaletilwe mhangala yumwi litawa lyake Lasalo, akali amemile fikong'o muvili vonda. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Lasalo adobokile kugavilwa masigalio gegaguwe kuhuma pa mesa lya yula mmosi. Na mibuwa vakali vakumuheleliye na kumnafilicha fikong'o fyake. <verse eid="LUK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />“Pambele Lasalo akafue, baho vandumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi vakamtegule na vakamvika pepi na Ibulahimu. Munu mmosi filafila akafue, baho akasihilwe. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Yula mmosi akali na magudo ukoya ku inyi lya vanu yevafuwe, akalolile kukyanya, akamwene Ibulahimu kwa utali pamwi na Lasalo yeakali pepi lyake. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Ifyo yula mmosi akamkemela, ‘Daada Ibulahimu, niwonele lusungu! Mlagiche Lasalo achwike kyala kyake mumalenga apoleche lulimi lyangu, kwakuva nene ndigehe mumagudo makomi mulyoto ugu.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Ila Ibulahimu akamuhigile, ‘Uwike mwana vangu, peukali wikwikala kwako ukawanuke njowo nofu, ila Lasalo akawanuke makani mahofu. Ila nonde Lasalo agehe baha ekeduka. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Pamwi na ago, pagati lyetu na nyenye kuvikilwe lilindi likomi, neke munu yeisaka kuhagama kuhuma kuno kwacha kwa nyenye alemwe, filafila kwehela munu yeiswesa kuhagama kuhuma kwa nyenye kwacha kwa nefwe.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Yula munu mmosi akalongile, ‘Nonde ndikusuka daada vangu mlagiche Lasalo ahele kukaye lyangu, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />mumo kugehe na vakolo vangu vahanu. Mleke ahele kuvalongela, vabahile kugita sambi, neke vabihile kwacha baha pono pamagudo.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Ibulahimu akamuhingie, ‘Ukoya kwevagehe lukolo vako, vagehe na malagicho gya Musa na Vavichi va Nguluvi, valeke vavapulike havo.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Ila mmosi akalongie, ‘Hamu, daada Ibulahimu. Ila ngita munu ichulubuka kuhuma mu inyi lya vanu vevafuwe na kuvahelelea davileka sambi na kumuwuyila Nguluvi.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Ibulahimu akamlongela, ‘Ngita sevidikila malagilicho gya Musa na vavichi va Nguluvi, sevidikila hata munu yeachulubuke kuhuma mu inyi lya vevafuwe.’”<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ikanila sambi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:6">Matayo 18.6</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:7">7</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Maliko 9.42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Baho, Yesu akavalongela vachulila vake, “Makani gegakuvagita vanu vagite sambi dagivecha figono fyonda, ila dailava yula munu yeileta makani ago. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Kwa munu uyo ivecha ngiba awopwe lwala musingo lyake na kutagwa muinyanza, kuliko kumgita yumwi va vanu yevakunifwata agite sambi. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Mwiyilolele! Ngita lukolo vako akugitie nongwa, umlakilile, peidikila sambi chake, mlekele sambi. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Ngita akugitile sambi mala saba kwa kigono, kila mala iwuya kwaveve akilonga, ‘Ndihongicha,’ Mlekele sambi.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuse iwulanicha mbatwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Vanjagila va Nguluvi vakamlongie Mtwa, “Utulutichie mbatwa.”<verse eid="LUK 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Yesu akavahigile, “Ngita muveche na mbatwa ndodo ngita mbeyu lya haladali, mngevesa kuulongela libiki hilo lya likuyu, ‘Tupuka ukayivyale muinyanza,’ nawo ungevapulika.<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kasi lya mnyigendwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />“Tulonge yumwi venu munya mnyigendwa yeigima awu yeikwamila kondolo. Wuli, peiwuya kuhuma pa mgunda akumlongela uyo mchulila, wache tandi ukale panyi uliye kyakulia? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Hamu! Ila akumlongela, ‘Nditelekele kyakulia, fwale unofu wache kunigundamikila mbaka pendisinda kulia na kunyuwa, baho na veve uliye na kunyuwa!’ <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Wuli, akumuhongecha uyo mchulila kwa kuvaagitile kyealongilwe? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Filafila nyenye pemsindile kugita kyemlongilwe, longeni, ‘Nefwe ndi vachulila twihela, tugitile hela gala getutakilwe kugita.’”<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvananicha venye ukalavilo chumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Yesu akiva mulugendo kuhelela ku Yelusalemu achumbile mumbaka va Samalia na Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Peakali ikwingila pa kijiji kimwi, vanu chumi venye ukalavilo vatang'anile nave, vemile patali. <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />Vakabwatukile vakilonga, “Yesu, Mtwa, tuwonele lusungu!”<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Peavawene avalongie, “Muhelele mukajiwonese kwa vatekechi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:14">Suwe pevali vihelela, vakang'alichwe. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Yumwi vawo pealolile kuva ananichwe, awuyile kwa Yesu kuno akimnjuma Nguluvi kwa lichwi likomi. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Akafugamile pautalo lya magulu gya Yesu kuno akimulumba. Munu uyo akali ihumila ku Samalia. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Yesu akalongile, “Wuli, sevananichwe vanu vonda chumi? Vala tisa vagehe kwiya? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Wuli, ndi mgenji uyu hela yeawuyile kumgavila ukomi Nguluvi?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Yesu akamlongie, “Wime uhelele, kwidikila kwako kukunaniche.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwacha kwa Ung'achale va Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Matayo 24.23-28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Chipindi chimwi, Vafalisayo vamuhuchile Yesu, “Ung'achale va Nguluvi ukwacha panili?” Mwene akavahigile, “Ung'achale va Nguluvi seukwacha ngita kinu kyeukukiwona kwa meho. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Kwihela munu yeiwesa kulonga, ‘Lole ugehe baha,’ awu ‘Ugehe pala.’ Kwakuva Ung'achale va Nguluvi ugehe pagati lyenu.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Baho avalongie vachulila vake, “Figono fyefikwacha mudoboka kulola mwinga vapo lya figono fya Mwana va Munu, ila semukwilola. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Na vanu vakuvalongela, ‘Mlole, agehe pala!’ Awu ‘Mlole, agehe baha!’ Ila nyenye msihume vala mbiile kuva nyilila. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Muchele kuva mwana va munu peiwuya, ikwacha ngita lung'ali lwelung'alicha bahobaho na kulangacha lubali chonda kuluhano. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Ila daing'ang'wa agude hilo na akanilwe na vanu va kilelo iki. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Ngita yali pa kigono kya Nuhu, ndifyo daivecha pa kigono kya kuwuya kwa Mwana va Munu. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Vanu vendeliye kulia na kunyuwa, kutola na kutauka mbaka vakati gula Nuhu peingie muwato mkomi weukemelwe safina. Ulava wahumie na kuvadocha vonda. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Kangi ikali ndeni mu kigono kya Lutu. Vanu vendelie kulia na kunyuwa, kugula na kugucha, kuvyala mbeyu na kuchenga. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Ila kigono kila Lutu peahegile Sodoma, lyoto na maganga gegikwaka kakaikile ngita ndonya na kuvadocha vonda. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Ifi ndifyo pedaivecha mukigono kila Mwana va Munu peigubutuliwa.<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />“Kigono ikyo, munu yeyonda yeivecha pakyanya lya kituvili abihile kwika kuhelela kunyamula finu fyake mugati, filafila mwene yeagehe pa mgunda abihile kuwuya ku kaye kunyamula kyokyonda. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Muwike gegamupatile mdala va Lutu. <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Munu yeyonda yeikela kuwokola wumi vake, akugayaganisa na munu yeyonda yeakugayaganisa wumi vake, akuuwokola. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Ndikuvalongela, kigono ikyo pamiye vanu vavili vivecha vavasile pamwi paulili, yumwi enyamulwa na yula yungi ilekwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Vadala vavili davavecha vidibula pamwi, yumwi enyamuliwa na yula yungi ilekwa.” <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Vanu vavili davavecha vigita kasi pamwi pa mgunda, yumwi enyamuliwa na yula yungi ilekwa.<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Baho vachulila vake vakamuhuchile, “Mtwa, aga gihumila kwiya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Na Yesu akavahigile kwa musemo akilonga, “pepagehe na musoga, vandapu vakwilundasa.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Mwigane na muhiga nongwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Baho, Yesu akavahumulile vachulila vake mufano kwa kuvawulanicha kuva ving'ang'wa kusuka mbepali na vabihile kudumula ng'efu. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Alongile, “Mumwani gumwi kukali na muhiga nongwa, mwene akali seakumwogofya Nguluvi vala seakampulike munu. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Mu mwani ugo, kukali na mdala yumwi mwigane amhelelie yula muhiga nongwa mala cholofu na akisuka ‘Nditange ndipate kyendikela kugavilwa kuhuma kwa mchindwama vangu!’ <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Kwa figono fyolofu muhiga nongwa yula akalemile kumutanga yula mgane. Ila pambele alongile, ‘Hata ngita nene sendikumwogofya Nguluvi vala sendikuvakela vanu, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />ila kwakuva uyu mwigane akunisumbula ndikumgavila kyeikelilwa kugavila, neke abihile kwendelela kila figono kundichosa hilo!’”<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Baho Mtwa endelile kulonga, “Mpulikiche alongago huyu muhiga muwofu. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Wuli, Nguluvi seakuvatetela vala vanu yeavahague, yevakumvembela pamie na pamunyi? Wuli, seigita kisatu kuvatanga? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Ndikuvalongela Nguluvi akuvatanga kisatu. Wuli, Mwana va Munu dapeikwacha mu inyi, dakuvawona vanu vevamdikie Nguluvi?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufano va Mfalisayo na mnyamula usulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Baho Yesu kavalongela mufano ugu vala vevikwilola kuva nde vasanzi na kuvabeda vangi. <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />“Vanu vavili vakang'ie kuhelela mu kaye lya Nguluvi kusuka. Yumwi Mfalisayo, yungi mnyamula usulu. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Mwene Mufalisayo emile, asukile munumbula, ‘Ndikuhongecha veve Nguluvi kwa kuva nene se ngita vanu vangi, vahichi na vagita uwofu na vagoni. Vala nene sendiwana na mwene mnyamula usulu na seidikila. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Nene ndidinda kuliya na kunyuwa figono fivili mu figono saba, ndihecha pono pa kumi lya finu fyonda fyendipatile.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Ila yula mnyamula usulu, akiva emile kwa utali vala sealolile kuluhano, ila akagundime kwa kusugwima, alongile, ‘Eve Nguluvi, uniwonele lusungu nene munya sambi.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Baho Yesu akavalongela,” “Uyu mnyamula usulu awuyile pakaye lyake kuno akiva agitilwe msanji pautalo lya Nguluvi kuchumba yula Mfalisayo yungi. Kwakuva munu yeyonda yeakujigita mkomi ivecha mdodo na yeakijigita mdodo ivecha mkomi.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvafunya vana vadodo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matayo 19.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maliko 10.13-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Kigono kimwi vanu vamsindikie Yesu vana vadodo neke avavikie mawoko na avafunye. Vachulila pevalolile ndena vakavalakilila. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Ila Yesu avakemelie vana vamuhelie akalongile, “Muvaleke vavo vana vache kwa nene, mbihile kuvakanila, kwakuva Ung'achale va Nguluvi ndi va vanu vevali ngita vana havo. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Ndakyene ndikuvalongela, munu yeyonda yeibihila kuwanuka Ung'achale va Nguluvi ngita mwana mdodo, seikwingila pa Ung'achale ng'odo.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munu mmosi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matayo 19.16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maliko 10.17-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Mkomi yumwi Muyawudi, amuhuchile Yesu, “Muwulanichi mnofu, ndigite liki neke ndiwese kuupata wumi va mbepali?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yesu akamhuchile, “Wuli ukunikemela mnofu? Kwihela yeagehe msanji ila Nguluvi weka hela. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Ukugachela malagicho gya Musa, ‘Ubihile kutana ugoni na ubihile kudocha, ubihile kuhicha na ubihile kudeta udesi na vaginye daada vako na maye vako.’”<verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Munu uyo akamhigile, “Ago gonda ndikagakolele kuhuma muwana vangu.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Yesu peapulike ago, akamlongie, “Upwemusilwe na kinu kimwi. Uhelele uguche umosi vako wonda, uvagavile vahangala icho sendi, nave wivecha na fupo lyako kuluhano, baho wache ndifwate.” <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Ila yula munu peapulike ago, asugwime hilo kwakuva akali mmosi hilo.<verse eid="LUK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yesu peamwonile isugwima, akalongile, “Ndi ukangafu munu mmosi kwingila mu Ung'achale va Nguluvi! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Ndakyene ndi upefu hilo kwa mung'oko yeikemelwa ngamia kuchumba mukibwenge lya sasiya, kuliko mmosi kwingila mu Ung'achale va Nguluvi.”<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Vala vanu pevapulike ago, vakahucha, “Nonde ngita ndi ukangafu, ndi ani yeiwesa kwokolewa?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yesu ahigile, “kinu kyesekiwesekine kwa vanu, kwa Nguluvi kiwesekana.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Baho Peteli akalongile, “Lole nefwe! Tulekile finu fyonda tukufwata veve!”<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yesu akavalongie, “Ndakyene ndikuvalongela, munu yeyonda yealekile kaye lyake awu mdala vake awu vakolo vake awu vasasi vake awu vana vake kwajili lya Ung'achale va Nguluvi, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />ikwanuka finu fyolofu mu figono ifi na ikwanuka wumi va mbepali pakigono kyekikwacha.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ilagula mala lya udatu kufuwa na kuchulubuka kwake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matayo 20.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maliko 10.32-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yesu akavategue vala vachulila chumi na vavili, akavalongie, “Mulole! Twihelela ku Yelusalemu na ukoya kila kinu kyekisimbilwe na vavichi va Nguluvi kya Mwana va Munu kihumila. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Kwakuva akusindikwa na kubatwa na vanu se Vayawudi, navo vakumbeda na vakumliga na kumfunyila miti. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Vakumtova ndomondo na kumdocha, ila kigono kya udatu echulubuka.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Ila vachulila vake sevachelile njowo icho. Vafihilwe mana lya njowo icho, sevachelile kyekilongilwe.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumnanicha munu yeapofwike meho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matayo 20.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maliko 10.46-52</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Yesu peafikile pepi na mwani va Yeliko, kukali na munu yumwi yeapofwike meho ekalile pang'asi akisuka. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Munu yula yeabofwike meho, peapulike lipinga lya vanu lichumba akahuchile, “Kuna liki?”<verse eid="LUK 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Vala vanu vakamuhigile, “Yesu va Nasaleti echumba.”<verse eid="LUK 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Mwene apasile lichwi akilonga, “Yesu, Mwana va Dawudi, niwonele lusungu!”<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Vale vanu yevalongue vakamlakila ayigale, ila mwene endelie kubwatika. “Mwana va Dawudi, niwonele lusungu!”<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yesu emile, akavalagiche vamsindike munu uyo kwamwene. Yula yeapofwike meho peafikile pepi, Yesu akamuhuchile, <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />“Ukela ndikugitile liki?” Mwene akahigile.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">“Mtwa, ndikela kulola.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Yesu akamlongie, kwakuva unidikile, “Nonde lole!”<verse eid="LUK 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Bahabaho yula yeapofwike meho akavesa kulola, akamfuatile Yesu akimnjuma Nguluvi. Vanu vonda pevalolile ago navo fifila vamnjuma Nguluvi.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na Sakayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yesu ingie mwani va Yeliko, akichumba mu ng'asi cha mwani ugo. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Mu mwani wula kukali na munu yumwi litawa lyake Sakayo, mkomi va vanyamula usulu na akali agehe na finu fyolofu. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Mwene akali ekela kumlola Yesu agehe wuli, ila seawesile kwakuva lipinga lya vanu likali likomi na mwene ali kanduli. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Ifyo akanyilile kutalo lya lila lipinga, akang'ie pakyanya lya libiki lya likuyu neke avese kumlola Yesu, kwakuva Yesu akali ichumba mu ng'asi yila. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Suwe Yesu peafikile pono pala alolile pakyanya, akamlongie, “Sakayo, ukwike kisatu, kwakuva nditakilwa ndihuwe pakaye lyako.”<verse eid="LUK 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Ifyo Sakayo ekile kisatu, akamwanuke Yesu mukaye lyake kwa lukeduko. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Vanu vonda pevalolile ago, vavangile kung'ong'oleka vakilonga, “Ahele kuva mgenji kwa munu munya sambi.”<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Ila Sakayo emile, akamlongie Yesu, “Lole, Mtwa! Nene ndikuvagavila vahangala nusu lya finu fyangu, ngita ndimnyagile munu yeyonda kinu, ndikumuwuyisila mala chitai.”<verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yesu akamlongie, “Neng'uli ukombosi ufikile mukaye iyi, kwa fila uyu nave, ndi ulelo va Ibulahimu <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Kwakuva Mwana va Munu achile kuvasaka na kuvawokola vanu yevayagile.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufano va vanyigendwa chumi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Matayo 25.14-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Vanu vevakali vakumpulikicha Yesu, vakati ugo vakali pepi na kufikila ku Yelusalemu na vanu vala vahochiole lya kuva Ung'achale va Nguluvi wikwacha saa yiyila. Akavalongie mfano ugu, <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />“Kukali na munu yumwi va ukolo va kiung'achale yeagitile lugendo kuhelela inyi lya kutali neke agitwe kuva ng'achale, baho awuye. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Ifyo peakali have kuhega, akavakemelie vachulila vake kumi, akavagavie sendi cholofu na kuvalongela, ‘Muve mwigula finu na kugucha finu mbaka pendiwuya.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Ila vanu va inyi lyake vakali vakumvipila, vakavalagiche vananzi kuhele kwa vanu vala vakavalongie, ‘Setukumukela munu uyu aveche ng'achale vetu.’<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />“Ila munu yula akagavilwe ung'achale na kuwuya kukaye lyake. Bahobaho akavakemela vachulila vake yevakali avagavie sendi, neke achele kyevapatile. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Mnyigedwa va kwanja akaachile, akalongie, ‘Mtwa, filundo fya sendi fyeukanilekie fiwongeleke filundo fingi chumi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Yula mtwa akamuhigile, ‘Ugitile unofu mchulila msanji! Kwakuva uvechile mwadikila pa njowo ndodo, wivecha na umwimike mumwani chumi!’ <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Na va uvili akaachile akamlongie ‘Mtwa, kihundo kya sendi kyako kyeundilekie chiwongelekile filundo fihano.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Na mwene akamlongie, ‘Na veve wivecha mkomi va mwani mihanu.’<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />“Baho mnyigendwa yungi akaachile, alongile, ‘Mtwa tegule kihundo kya sendi lyako, ndikahopile unofu mulupembo neke ibihile kuyaga, <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Ndikakuwogofye kwakuva veve nde munu mkangafu, witegula finu fyeseuvivikile na wibene fyeseuvyalile.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Na mtwa vake akamlongie, ‘Eve mchulila mwafu! Ndikuhiga nongwa kwa kila kyeulongile, uchelile kuva nene ndi munu mkangafu, nditegula finu se fyanene na ndibena fila fyesendivyalile. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Wuli, seukavikile kihondo kya sendi lyangu kwa vanu yeviyasimisa sendi na pendiwuya ndianuke kuno iwongelike?’ <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Baho akavalongie vevaimile bahala, ‘Mnyageni iyo kihondo kya sendi, mkampele yula yeapatile filundo kumi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Navo vakamlongie, ‘Mtwa, agehe na fwayida lya sendi kumi!’ <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Mwene akavahiga, ‘Ndikuvalongela kuva kila yeagehe na kinu iwongelechewa, ila mwene yeihela kinu, hata kila kyeinakyo nakyo inyagwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Nonde, vala vachindwama vangu yevikana nene kuvecha ng'achale vawo, muvalete baha, mukavadoche kuno nene pendikuvalola.’”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ekwingila Yelusalemu kwa fihekelelo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matayo 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maliko 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohani 12.12-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Yesu peamalile kulonga ago, akavalongola kuhelela ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Peali pepi na kufika mufijiji fya Betifage na kijiji kya Betania, pepi na kidunda kyekimemile mibiki gya Miseituni, avalagiche vachulila vake vavili, <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />akavalongie, “Muhelele pa kijiji kyemkiwona. Pemwikwingila mu kijijini ikyo, mukumulola Mwana lipunda awopilwe seakang'aliwe na munu yeyonda, mumdindule na mumlete baha.<figure style="fig" file="15 Colt.jpg" size="col" ref="19.30">Mwana va punda</figure> <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Munu akuvahucha wuli mkumuwopola, mlongieni, ‘Mtwa akumusaka.’”<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Suwe, vakahele vakawene kila kinu ngita fila Yesu peakali avalongie. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Pevali vakumuwopola yula mwana punda, mtwa munya punda akavahuchile, “Wuli, mkumuwopola mwana punda uyu?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Vachulila vake vamuhigile, “Mtwa akumusaka.” <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Suwe, vakamsindikie Yesu yula mwana punda, vakatandandasile myenda gyawo pamgongo lya punda, vachulila vake vakamtangile kukang'ala pakyanya lyake. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Yesu peali ikwendelela na lugendo, vanu vandandasile myenda gyawo mung'asi.<verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Peafikile pepi na Yelusalemu, pa ligema va kidunda kya Miseituni, lipinga likomi lya vanu na vachulila vake vavagile luhekelelo na kumnjuma Nguluvi kwa gala umanyitu gevawonile. <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Vakali velonga, “Afunywe Ng'achale yelagichwe na Mtwa Nguluvi atavale. Ulutengamaso kuluhano, ukomi pakyanya ku kuluhano!”<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Vamonga va Vafalisayo vakali pa lila lipinga lya vanu vakamlongie Yesu, “Mvawulanichi, valongele vachulila vako vayigale.”<verse eid="LUK 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yesu akamuhigile, “Ndikuvalongela, ngita hava davachika, maganga aga gibwatuka.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvavembela vanu va mwani va Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Yesu peali pepi na mwani va Yelusalemu na pevawonile akavavembilie, <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />akalongie, vanu va mwani ugu, “Ndikali ndisaka hata neng'uli muchele njowo chakugita neke muveche ulutengamaso, ila nonde gafihilwe semwiwesa kuilola ulutengamaso. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Kwakuva figono dafikwacha, vachindwama vako vakuchengela lukanji mnofu davakuchungutila mwani vako vonda, baho nde vakukusambulia kuhuma lubali chonda. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Vakukinyanga veve pamwi na vana vako mugati lya lukanji chako, sevakulileka hata liganga limwi pakyanya lya lingi, kwakuva seukachelile chipindi kwa Nguluvi peachile kukowokola.”<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ihelela pa Kaye lya Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matayo 21.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maliko 11.15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohani 2.13-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Baho Yesu akaingie mulidamo pa Kaye lya Nguluvi, akavagile kuvadaga kwivala vala vevakali vevigucha finu, <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />akavalongie, “Nguluvi akalongile mu masimbo, ‘Kaye lyangu ivecha Kaye lya kufunyila.’ Ila nyenye muigitile kuva manga lya vahichi.” <verse eid="LUK 19:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Kila figono Yesu akali iwulanicha pa Kaye lya Nguluvi. Vatekechi vakomi na vawulanichi va malagicho na vilongosi va vanu vasakile kumdocha, <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />ila vesapatile ng'asi lya kumdochela, kwakuva vanu vonda vakali vakumpulikicha.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ahuchwa umwimike vake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matayo 21.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maliko 11.27-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Kigono kimwinga Yesu peakali akuvawulanicha vanu pa Kaye lya Nguluvi na kuvadalikia Njowo Chinofu, vatekechi vakomi na vawulanichi va malagicho pamwi na vakomi vakafikile, <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />vakamuhuchile, “Tulongele! Kwa umwimike va ani wigita ago? Nde ani yeakugavile umwimike ugu?” <verse eid="LUK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yesu akavahigile, “Na nene ndikuvahucha. Mundongele, <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />wuli, umwimike va Yohani va kubatisa ukahumile kwa Nguluvi awu kwa vanu?”<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Valonganile vavene kwa vavene, “Ngita tukilonga uhumile kwa Nguluvi mwene daituhucha, ‘Wuli, semkumwindikie Yohani?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Na tukilonga, ‘Gahumile kwa vanu,’ vanu vonda va baha vakututova na maganga, kwakuva vonda vidikila kuva Yohani akali mvichi va Nguluvi.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Suwe, vakamuhigile, “Setuchela yeamgavile Yohani umwimike va kubatisa.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Yesu akavalongie, “Na nene sendikuvalongela ndigita njowo ichi kwa umwimike va ani.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfano va mgunda va misabibu na valimi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matayo 21.33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maliko 12.1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Yesu endelie kuvalongela vanu mfano ugu, “Munu yumwi avyalile misabibu ku mgunda vake, akavakodisile kwa valimi, baho akahegile kuelela inyi yingi, ekalile ukoya kya figono fyolofu. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Chipindi cha mabeno pefifikile, Munu huyo amlagiche mchulila vake kwa vala valimi, akategule masumo ga mabenelo gya misabibu. Ila vala valimi vakamtovile mnyingendwa yula vakamdagile mawoko ng'ani. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Yula munya mgunda akamlagiche kangi mchulila yungi, ila vawo vakamtovile yula na vakamgitie unjanganifu na vakamdagile mawoko ng'ani. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Munya mgunda akamlagiche munu va udatu, uyo kangi vakamlemacha na kumtaga kwivala lya mgunda. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Yula mtwa munya mgunda va misabibu ahochile, Ndigita wuli? ‘Ndikumlagicha mwana vangu ndimkeliye, ndakyene vakumginya.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Vala valimi pevamuwene hela, vakalonganile, ‘Mwene nde mhala va mgunda. Suwe, tumdoche neke uhala vake uve vetu.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Ndeni, vakamuhechile kwivala lya mgunda lya misabibu vakamdocha.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">“Yesu akavahuchile, wuli mtwa munya mgunda akuvagita liki valimi avo?” <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />“Uyo munya mgunda, daikwacha na kuvadocha avo valimi na kuvagavila valimi vangi mgunda ugo va msabibu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Vanu pevapulike njowo icho, vakalongile, “Hamu njowo ichi chibihile kutuhumila!”<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Ila Yesu akavahumichie meho, akalongile, “Masimbo aga ga Nguluvi gana mana liki?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">‘Liganga lyelikanilwe vachengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">nonde livechile likanga likomi lya kulubali?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Munu yeyonda dayeiguwa pakyanya lya liganga idenyeka denyeka, dakumguliya munu yeyonda, likumkinya hilo.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vanu vakumuhucha Yesu njowo cha kuhomba usulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matayo 22.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maliko 12.13-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Vawulanichi va malagicho na vatekechi vakomi vachelile kuva mufano wula valongilwe vavene, ndeni vakasakile kumwibata bahobaho, ila vakavaogofya vanu. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Kwa ifyo vakomi havo vakali vakumfisila Yesu vambate. Suwe, vakavagavile vanu sendi vambate Yesu, vanu havo vayigite vasanzi endee vakali visaka ng'asi lya kumbata Yesu kwa kumuhucha mahucho, neke vakamlate kwa mtavala va Kilumi munya umwimike na ludali. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Vanu havo vakamlongie, “Muwulanichi twichela kuva wilonga na kuwulanicha njowo cha undakyene, tuchela kuva veve sewibagula, veve wiwulanicha ngita Nguluvi peikela. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Wuli, ikanicha kuhomba usulu kwa ng'achale awu seunofu?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Yesu akachelile mpango vawo, akavalongie, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />“Munigavile sendi. Wuli, wuso na litawa ilyi lya ani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">Navo vakamuhigile, “Ndi lya ng'achale.” <verse eid="LUK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Yesu akavalongie, “Suwe, fya mung'achale mumgavile ng'achale na fya Nguluvi mumgavile Nguluvi.”<verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Ifyo vakalemwile kumubata kwa gala geakali ilonga pautalo lya vanu. Navo vadudwive hilo na mahigo gake, vakachikile chii.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhucho lwa kuchulubuka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matayo 22.23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maliko 12.18-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Vamonga va Masadukayo, vala vevilonga kuva kwihela uchulubuko, vakamuhelelie Yesu na kumuhucha, <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />“Muwulanichi, Musa atusimbilie, ‘Ngita munu gaafililwe na lukolo munya mdala ila sealekile mwana, munu uyo etakilwa amutole yula mwigane, neke ambabile lukolo vake vana.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Suwe, vakali lukolo saba, mlongola atolile na mwene afuwe bila kuleka vana. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Yula lukolo va wuvili akamtolile yula mwigane na mwene afuwe bila kuleka vana. <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />Baho lukolo vaudatu akamuhala yula mgane na mwene akafuwe na ikali filafila vonda saba vakali vamuhalile mwegane yula na vonda vakafuwe bila kuleka vana. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Pambele na yula mgane akafuwe. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Nonde, kigono kya vanu kuchulubuchwa yula mgane daivecha mdala va ani? Kwakuva daatolilwe na lukolo vonda saba.”<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yesu akavalongie, “Vanu vevikwikala mu inyi iyi, hutola na kutolwa, <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />ila vevitakilwa kuchulubuchwa ndi vala vevahaguliwe na Nguluvi, havo sevitola vala kutolwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Ndakyene sefifuwa ng'odo, kwakuva vivecha ngita vandumindumi va Nguluvi. Vavo ndi vana va Nguluvi kwakuva vachulubuchwe. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Ila, kwa njowo cha kuchulubuchwa kwa vanu, ata Musa awonise ifyo mu mumasimbo ga Nguluvi, isimbilwe endee kisako kyekikali kikwaka lyoto na baho Mtwa Nguluvi akamlongie, mwene ndi Nguluvi va Ibulahimu na Nguluvi va Isaka na Nguluvi va Yakobo. <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Mwene se Nguluvi va vanu vevafue ila mwene ndi Nguluvi va vanu vevagehe mumi, kwakuva kwa mwene vonde ndi wumi.”<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Vamonga va vawulanichi va malagicho vakalongie, “Muwulanichi uhigile unofu hilo.” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Na vene sevagechile kumuhucha kangi ha.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilisito ndi Mwana va ani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matayo 22.41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maliko 12.35-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Baho, Yesu avahuchile, “Ivecha wuli vanu valonge Kilisito yeahaguliwe na Nguluvi ndi Mwana va Dawudi? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Dawudi yumwene asimbile mukiganulo kya Sabuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">‘Mtwa amlongie Mtwa vangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">Kale lubali lwangu lwa kuliya,<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />mbaka ndikugite uvawese vachindwama vako uvatavale vaveche panyi lyako, ngita kigoda kya kuvikila magulu.’<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Ikiva Dawudi akumkemela Kilisito, ‘Mtwa vangu,’ Daivecha wuli Kilisito yeahuguliwe na Nguluvi aveche mwana va Dawudi?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu pamwi na vawulanichi va malagicho gya Musa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matayo 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maliko 12.38-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Vanu vonda pevakali vikumpulikicha Yesu, akavalongie vachulila vake kuva. <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />“Muyilolele na vawulanichi va malagicho, ambavo vikela kugendagenda kuno vafwalile mihingila mitali. Na vikela kuhungilwa na vanu kwa unginyange musoko na kukala pautalo lya mukaye lya Kutang'anila Vayawudi na kukala figoda fya pautalo mulihungu. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Vakuvahichila vagane mkaye lyake, kuno vakuyigita vene vanu vasanzi kwa Nguluvi na kumsuka Nguluvi kwa muda mutali. Ava davapatila asabu ngomi.”<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Usembe va maye mwigani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Maliko 12.41-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Baho Yesu akavawene vamosi pevakali vehecha usembe chawo mulisanduku lya lusanja lya mukaye lya Nguluvi. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Filafila akamwene maye yumwi mwigani ihecha sendi mulisanduku sendi chivili. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Suwe, akavalongie, “Ndakyene ndikuvalongela, maye uyu mwigani muhangala ahechile kuchumba vanu vangi vonda. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Kwakuva vangi vonda vahechile usembe kidodo kuhuma muuhala vawo, ila uyu maye, ingava muhangala, ahechile kila kinu kyekimtanga kwikala.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ilagula kuhanangwa kwa Kaye lya Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matayo 24.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Maliko 13.1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Vamonga va vachulila vakali viywanga njowo cha Kaye lya Nguluvi, namuna peichengilwe kwa maganga manofu, pamwi na usembe chechihumichwe kwa Nguluvi. <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />Yesu akavalongie, “Aga gyonda gyemkugalola, figono fikwacha kwihela hata liganga limwi lyelisigalia pakyanya lya lingi, kila kinu kitung'uliwa.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utumama na magudo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matayo 24.3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Maliko 13.3-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Baho, vachulila avo vakamuhuchile Yesu, “Muwulanichi njowo icho chihumila panili? Datuwonela kimanyilo liki dakiwonesa kuva pepi njowo icho kuhumila?”<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yesu akavahigile, “Muyilolele, mbihile kuchangwa. Kwakuva volofu vihumila na davakwacha kwa litawa lyangu vakilonga, nene ndi Kilisito, kangi davilonga, mwiso va inyi ugehe pepi kwacha. Ila nyenye mbihile kuvafwata. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Pempulika njowo cha fita na magudo, mbihile kwogopa, kwakuva makani ago lasima gihumile tandi, ila yila mwiso va inyi wave kufika.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Baho Yesu akaendelie kulonga, “Vanu va inyi yimwi davitovana na vanu va inyi yingi, ung'achale umwi daukwitova na ung'achale wungi. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Kila pono kwivecha na mganga weuhogoseka, lumyayo na mitamwa gyolofu. Vanu davawona makani makomi gyakogofya na kimanyilo kikomi kihumila kulufunde. <verse eid="LUK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Ila ago gonda gakiva gave kuhumila, davavakuvabata, davakuvagudisa na kuvasindika mukaye lya kutang'anila Vayawudi na kuvavika mukiwopo, musindikwa kwa vang'achale na vakomi va vatavala kwakuva nyenye munidikile nene. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Na iyi daivecha fwasi lyenu kuvadalikila Njowo Nofu. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Muveche vakangafu munumbula chenu kuva damuhiga liki ukoya, <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />kwakuva nene mwene ndikuvagavila njowo cha kulonga na luhala, hata vachindwama venu davawesila hamu kusindana nalyo vala kuipinja. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Na nyenye mwikanwa na vasasi venu na lukolo venu na vaganja venu. Na vamonga venu mudochwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Vanu vonda davakuvavipila nyenye kwakuva nyenye ndi vachulila. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Ila hata lufwili lumwi lya mituwe gyenu dalwiyaga. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Kufumilila kwa nyenye, damugawokola numbula lyenu.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ilagula kwanangika kwa mwani va Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Matayo 24.15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Maliko 13.14-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />“Pemulola mwani va Yelusalemu uchungutilwe na vapuga, baho muchele kuva chipindi chifikile cha kuhanangwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Baho vevagehe mu inyi lya Yudea vanyilile mufidunda, na vala vevagehe kumwani vahege, vala vevagehe ku mgunda vabihile kuwuya mu mwani. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Kwakuva figono ifyo ndi figono fya kutangwa, neke gyonda gegasimbilwe mukiganulo kya Nguluvi, gagitwe. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Davilava, vala vevagehe na lusololo na vala yevikong'elecha kigono ikyo! Kwakuva daivecha na magudo makomi mu inyi na Ngulivi dakuvahiga nongwa vanu ava. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Vanu vangi davidochwa kwa lipanga na vanu vangi venyamuliwa vasutu na kusindikwa muinyi yingi. Na vanu se Vayawudi davautavala mwani va Yelusalemu kwa ludali na kuvagudisa vanu avo, mbaka fipindi fyawo pefitimila.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwacha kwa Mwana va Munu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matayo 24.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maliko 13.24-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />“Baho daivecha kimanyilo mulichuwa na mwechi na nondwa. Vanu vonda mu inyi dagivecha na magudo kwakuva lya uwogofu kuhumila na mdilimo na madaba gya inyanza. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Vatu davachilika kuhumila na wogofya na kugalola gala makani gegahumila muinyi, kwakuva ludali fya finu fyonda fya kulufunde dachihogocheka. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Baho davakumuwona Mwana va Munu ikwacha mu lifunde munya ludali na ukomi. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Suwe, pemuwona njowo icho dachihumila, mwime na kwinamula mituwe gyenu kukyanya, kwakuva ukombosi venu ugehe pepi.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufano va libiki lyelikemelwa mutini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matayo 24.32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maliko 13.28-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Baho Yesu akavalongie mufano ugu, “Mulolele libiki lya likuyu na mibiki gingi gyonda. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Pemulola givanga kuhumicha makwati, muchele kuva chipindi cha mabenelo gagehe pepi. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Na nyeye ifyo ifyo pemuwona makani aga gahumile, mchele kuva ung'achale va Nguluvi ugehe pepi.<verse eid="LUK 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />“Ndakyene ndikuvalongela, vanu va kilelo iki dasekichumba mbaka ago gyonda gagitwe. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Luhano na inyi dafichumba, ila njowo changu sengichumba ng'odo.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mukale meho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />“Mukale meho, numbula chenu chibihile kukwegwa na kulia hilo na kugala na kufwata maisa mahofu. Ngita semwigita ifyo, kigono kya kuwuya kwa Mwana va Munu seichelwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Kwakuva kikuvachila vanu vonda vevikwikala muinyi. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Mukale meho, figono fyonda, mumsuke Nguluvi figono fyonda, neke avatange kuchumba gyonda ambago gegihumila na kukwima pautalo lya Mwana va Munu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Vakati va pamunyi, figono fyonda, Yesu akali ekuvawulanicha vanu mukaye lya Nguluvi na pamie akali ihelela pa Kidunda kya Miseituni na kwikala ukoya. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Vanu vonda vakali vilamuka kinyola sagala na vihelela kumpulikicha Yesu peiwulanicha Mukaye lya Nguluvi.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Vayawudi visaka ng'asi lya kumudocha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayo 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maliko 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohani 11.45-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Lihungu lya mibumunda gyesevikwa lisimika, yeikemelwa lihungu lya Pasaka, ikali pepi kufika. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Vatekechi vakomi na vawulanichi va malagicho vakali visaka ng'asi lya kumdocha Yesu, ila vakavaogofya vanu.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda ikwidikila kumkana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matayo 26.14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Maliko 14.10-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Suwe, Setani akamwingie Yuda yeakemeliwe Isikalioti, yumwi vavala vachulila kumi na vavili. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Yuda akahele kwa vakomi va vatekechi na vakomi vapuga va kaye lya Nguluvi. Akaywanga navo fila peakumbata Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Nawo vakedukile na vakaidikilwe nave kumugavila sendi. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yuda akadikile na akavangile kusaka ng'asi lya kumsindika kwavo kwa lupwepo.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ikwandala kulia kyakulia kya Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matayo 26.17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maliko 14.12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohani 13.21-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Suwe, figono fya mibumuda gyeseivikilwe lisimika yafikile. Filafila ikali kigono kyakumuhinja mwana kondolo va Pasaka. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Ifyo, Yesu akavalagiliche Peteli na Yohani, akavalongie, “Muhelele mkatuandalile kyakulia kya Pasaka, neke tuvese kulia.” <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Navo vakamhucha, “Wisaka tukakuaandalile kwiya Pasaka?” <verse eid="LUK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Yesu akavalongie, “Mpulikiche! Pemuvecha muhelela ku mwani, mutang'ana na mgosi ategue kiviya kya malenga mumavega. Mumfwate mbaka mukaye yeikwingila. <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />Mumlongele munya kaye, ‘Muwulanichi akuhucha, kigehe kwiya kila kyumba kyekiandalilwe kwa Pasaka pamwi na vachulila vangu?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Mwene davawonesa kyumba kikomi kya kudali kiandaliswe suwe. Baho muandalise kyakula mumo.” <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Suwe, vakahele vawene kila kinu ngita Yesu peavalongie, vene vakaandalise kyakulia kya Pasaka.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kyakulia kya Mtwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matayo 26.26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maliko 14.22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">Vakolindo 11.23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Saa peifikile, Yesu ekalile kulia kyakulia pamwi na vanjagila vake. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Yesu akavalongie, “Ndikali ndikela hilo kulia Pasaka iyi pamwi na nyenye ndikiva ndave sendigudwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Nondee ndikuvalongela, sendilia kangi pamwi na nyenye mbaka pala ung'achale va Nguluvi peavakombola vanu vake vonda na kutavala.”<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Baho Yesu akanyamuwe kikombe kya difwayi, akahongiche, akalonga, “Mukitegule munywe vonda. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Nondee ndikuvalongela, sendinyuwa difai iyi mbaka ung'achale va Nguluvi pewikwacha.”<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Baho akanyamue libumunda, akahongiche, akauketule, akavagavila, akalonga, “Ugu ndi muvili gwangu wemugavilwe nyenye. Mugite ndeni kwa kuniwiwuka.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Fifila peamalile kulia kyakulia kya palumie akategue kikombe akalongie, “Kikombe iki ndi lyagano miya lyeliwonesa kuva ndakyene, kwa danda yeisukuka kwajili lyenu.<verse eid="LUK 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />“Ila, muyilolele! Munu yeakukana agehe baha iliya pamwi na nene. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Mwana va Munu ihelela kudochwa ngita Nguluvi peakela, ila dailava yula munu dakumkana Mwana va Munu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Baho vavangile kuhuchana ndi ani pagati lyawo yeigita njowo hilyo.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ani yeagehe mkomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Fifila vavangile kwihucha nde ani pagati lyao yeihochwa kuva mkomi kuchumba yungi. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yesu akavalongie, “Vang'achale va inyi ekuvatavala vanu kwa umwimike, navo vala vakomi vakwikemela, ‘Vaganja va vanu.’ <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Ila nyenye mbihile kuvecha ndeni pagati lyenu, yula yeagehe mkomi pagati lyenu na aveche mdodo va vonda, yeagehe kilongochi lasima aveche ngita yeigundamikila. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Wuli, ndi ani yeagehe mkomi? Wuli, ndi yula yeikwikala pa mesa awu ndi yula yeigundamika? Ndakyene ndi yula yeikwikala pa mesa kulia kyakulia. Ila nene ndigehe pagati lyenu ngita mnyigendwa.<verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />“Nyenye mukasigalie na nene pa magudo gyangu. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Na nene ndikuvagavila ung'achale ngita fila Daada vangu peandigavile nene. <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />Mwilia na kunyuwa pa mesa lyangu, pa ung'achale vangu na kwikala pa figoda kya ung'achale na kuvatavala na kuvahiga nongwa makabila chumi na gavili ga Isilaeli.<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ilagula kuva Peteli akumkana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayo 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maliko 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohani 13.36-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />“Yesu akamlongie, Simoni, Simoni! Pulikiche! Setani akamsukile Nguluvi kuvanenga nyenye ngita munu peipeta mpunga. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Ila nene ndikusukile kwa Nguluvi veve Simoni mbatwa lyako isipwemke. Nave peukuniwuyila kangi, uvatange lukolo vako.”<verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Mwene Peteli amuhigile, “Mtwa, nene ndidikie kuhehela na veve mukiwopo na ata kufuwa pamwi na veve.”<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yesu akamuhigile, “Ndikulongela veve Peteli, neng'uli livisi akiva ave kuvika dauvecha ukunikana mala chidatu ngita seukunichela.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhako, kihondo na Lipanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Baho Yesu akavahuchile vachulila vake, “Vakati pendivalagiche bila kihondo kya senti awu muhako awu mikobasi, mukapwemusilwe na kyokyonda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Vakahigila, “Hamu, setukapwemulwe na kinu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Nave akamlongie, “Ila nondee, munya kihondo kya sendi na ategule na yeagehe na kihako ategule. Na yeyonda yeahela lipanga, aguche mwenda gwake agule lipanga limwi. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Kwakuva gasimbilwe mumasimbo gya Nguluvi, ‘Akavalilwe pamwi na vene sambi.’ Makani ago gasimbilwe kwajili lyangu. Ndikuvalongala kuva gitakilwa gagitwe.”<verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Vachulila vakalongile, “Mtwa lole, baha pagehe na mipanga gavili.” Yesu akalongie, “Suwe!”<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumsuka Nguluvi pa kidunda kya miseituni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matayo 26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maliko 14.32-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yesu akahele pa kidunda kya Miseituni ngita peachovie, vachulila vake vakamfwatile. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Paafikile ukoya akavalongie, “Msuke, mbihile kwingila pa magecho.”<verse eid="LUK 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Baho akavaleka, akahele utali va munu kutaga liganga, akafugame kumsuka Nguluvi. <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />Akalongie, “Daada, ngita wikela, unihechele kikombe iki kya magudo kwa nene. Ila sengita ndikelafyo nene, ila ngita wikela veve.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Baho nduminduni va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi akamuhumie neke amgavile ludali. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Yesu akiva muuvasi ukomi, akakangie kumsuka Nguluvi. Lyaso lyake likali ngita madone ga danda gegaguwe mumhanga.<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Yesu peamalile kumfunya Nguluvi, avawuyilie vachulila vake, avawene vavasile, kwakuva vakali na luswigimo. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Akavalongie, “Wuli, mvasile? Mlamuke na mumsuke Nguluvi, mbihile kwingila mumagecho.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ebatwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matayo 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maliko 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yohani 18.3-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Yesu peakali ave ilonga, lipinga lya vanu lyachile kuno lilongwichwe na Yuda, yula yeakali yumwi va vala vachulila vake chumi na vavili, akamuhelelie Yesu na kumuhungila kwa kumnonela. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Ila Yesu akamhuchile, “Yuda! Wuli, ukumkana Mwana va Munu kwa kumnonela?”<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Vala vachulila vake pevalolige ago gegahumie vakahuchile, “Mtwa, tuvahinje kwa lipanga?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Yumwi vavala vachulila va Yesu, akamtova mnyingendwa va mtekechi mkomi na akamdumue lisigicha lyake lya kuliya.<verse eid="LUK 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Ila Yesu akalongile, “Mbihile kugita ndena.” Akalibyalisa lisigicha akamnaniche.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Baho Yesu akavalongie vakomi va vatekechi, vakomi va vadimaji va kaye lya Nguluvi na vavaha vevahelelie kumbata, “Wuli, mwachile na mipanga na findonga kunibata ngita nene muhichi? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Figono fyonda pendikali pamwi na nyenye mukaye lya Nguluvi semukanibatile. Ila iyi ndi saa lyenu, saa lya umwimike va kisi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peteli ekumkana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:57">Matayo 26.57</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:58">58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53">Maliko 14.53</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:54">54</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yohani 18.12-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Baho vakamubatile Yesu, vakamnyamue na kumsindika mu kaye lya mtekechi mkomi. Peteli akava akumfuwata kumbele kwa utali. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Vanu vala pevakali vafikile, vakakalile na kulota lyoto pagati lya lidamo vakali vekalile pamwi na Peteli akiva pamwi navo. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Mnyigendwa yumwi mdala peamwene Peteli akalile pepi na lyoto, akamuhumichie meho, akalongile, “Munu uyu na mwene akali pamwi na Yesu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Ila Peteli akanile akilonga, “Veve mdala nene sendikumchela munu uyu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Pambele ludodo, munu yungi akamwene Peteli, alongile, “Veve ndi yumwi vawo!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Ila Peteli akalongie, “Veve munu, se nene!”<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Pelichumbile lisaa limwi, munu yungi akaginile kulonga, “Ndakyene, munu uyu akali pamwi na Yesu, kwakuva mwene ndi Mgalilaya.” <verse eid="LUK 22:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Ila Peteli akalongie, “Veve munu, nene sendichela geulonga!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:60">Bahobaho ave ilonga, livisi likavikile. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Mtwa akasedukile na kumlolela Peteli, mwene Peteli akawuwike gala geakali alongilwe na Mtwa, “Neng'uli livisi akiva ave selivikile, ukunikana mala chidatu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Baho Peteli akahumile kwivala, akavembile kwa luswugwimo.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ebedwa na kutovwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Matayo 26.67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Maliko 14.65</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Vala vanu vevakali vakumdima Yesu, vavangile kumbeda na kumtova. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Vamuwopile meho na vakumuhucha, “Lagule ani akutovile?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Baho vakalongile makani gyolofu gya kumliga.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu isindikwa pautalo lya lidamo lya Vayawudi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matayo 26.59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Maliko 14.55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yohani 18.19-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Pekukie, vakomi va vatekechi na vawulanichi va malagicho vakatang'anile pamwi na vaka msindike Yesu palidamo lilo. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Navo vakamlongie, “Tulongele! Wuli, veve ndi Kilisito Mkombosi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Ila Yesu akavahigile, “Ndikivalongela dasemwidikila, <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />hata ndikivahucha lihucho, dasemkunihiga. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Ila kuvangila nondee, Mwana va Munu ivecha ekalile liwoko lyene ludali lya kuliya va Nguluvi munya umwimike.”<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Baho vonda vakamuhucha, “Tulongele veve ndi Mwana va Nguluvi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Nave akavahiga, “Nyenye mwilonga nene ndive.”<verse eid="LUK 22:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Navo vakalongile, “Wuli, twikumkela munu yungi alonge makani gake? Nefwe tumpulikiche akilonga kwa mulomo vake.”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s">Yesu esindikwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:1">Matayo 27.1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:2">2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maliko 15.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yohani 18.28-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Baho, vanu vemile kwa pamwi, vakamsindika Yesu pautalo lya Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Vavangile kumlata vakilonga, “Tukamwene munu uyu akivayagicha vanu vetu, akuvakanila vabihile kuhomba usulu kwa Kaisali na kwikemela mwene ndi Kilisito, Ng'achale va Kilumi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Pilato akamuhucha Yesu, “Veve ndi Ng'achale va Vayawudi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Yesu akamuhigila, “Ndakyene, ngita veve pewilonga.”<verse eid="LUK 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Pilato akavalogela vakomi va vatekechi na vakomi na lipinga lya vanu, “Sendiwona nongwa lyolyonda kwa munu uyu.”<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Ila vavo vakaginile kulonga, “Kwa mawulanicha gake akuvachovelela vanu vevagehe Yudea lyonda vipinge na Kaisali, avangile ku Galilaya, nondee agehe baha.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu esindikwa kwa Helode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Pilato peapulike ago, akahucha, “Wuli, munu uyu ihumila ku Galilaya?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Peachelile kuva Yesu akali ihumila pono yeigehe panyi lya umwimike va Helode, akamsindike kwa Helode, ambaye chipindi icho Helode akali ku Yelusalemu.<verse eid="LUK 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Helode peamuwonile Yesu akedukile hilo. Kwa figono fyolofu apulikige njowo chake na kuvangila daha akelile kumulola. Akali ichindila kulola kimanyilo kyeagitile na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Helode akamucha mahucho golofu, ila Yesu sehamuigile kyokyonda. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Vakomi vatekechi na vawulanichi va malagicho vihumile pautalo, vakamlatile Yesu malato gawo kwa kumlakilila. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Helode pamwi na vapuga vake, vakambedile na vakamkinile na kumfwalicha myenda gwa king'achale, vakamuwuyise kwa Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Kwakuva pamwandi Helode na Pilato vakali vachindwama, kuvangila baho vakali vaganja.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ihingwa kudochwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matayo 27.15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Maliko 15.6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohani 18.39—19.16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Suwe, Pilato akavakemela pamwi vakomi va vatekechi na filongochi va Vayawudi na vanu va mwani wula, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />akavalongie, “Mumletile munu uyu kwa nene mkilonga kuva akali akuvayagicha vanu. Nondee mpulikiche! Baho nene ndimuhuchile pautalo lyenu na sendimwene nogwa lyolyonda gakumlata uyu munu. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Se nene hela, hata Helode filafila seawonile nongwa lya munu uyu, nde mana amuwusile kwa nene. Ndakyene munu uyu seagitile kyokyonda kyekikumgita adochwe. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Ifyo ndilonga atovwe ndomondo, baho ndikumleka.” <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Kila lihungu lya Pasaka, Pilato akumulekechela muwopwa yumwi.<verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Ila vonda vatovile kyowo pamwi, “Muheche munu uyo, tulekele Balaba!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Balaba akali avikilwe mukiwopo kwa kugita ndewo na kudocha vanu ku mwani.<verse eid="LUK 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Pilato akelie kumulekela Yesu, ifyo akalongile navo kangi. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Ila vawo vatovile kyowo, “Muvambe mukipindilihicho! Muvambe mukipindilihicho!”<verse eid="LUK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Pilato akavahucha lya udatu, “Wuli, agitile kinu liki kiwofu? Sendiwona nogwa lyolyonda lyakumgita adochwe, kwa ifyo ndikumtova ndomondo, baho ndikumlekela.”<verse eid="LUK 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Ila vavo valutile kutova kyowo kwa ludali hilo, vakakelile Yesu muvambe mukipindilihicho. Na kwa kyowo chawo chikamgitile Pilato idikile. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Suwe, Pilato akaamule kugita ngita vanu vevikela kigitwe. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Akamulikelile yula munu yevamkelie, ambaye yeavikilwe mukiwopo kwa kugita ndewo na kudocha vanu na akamuhecha Yesu adochwe ngita pevakelile.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ivambwa mukipindilihicho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matayo 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maliko 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohani 19.17-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Vapuga pevali vakimsindika, vakatang'anile na munu yumwi yeakemeliwe Simoni yeihuma Kileni, akali ihuma kwivala lya mwani. Suwe, vakambatile, vakamtwikile wula kipindilihicho aunyamule kumbele lya Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Lipinga likomi lya vanu lyakamfwatila Yesu, pagati lyawo vakivecha vadala vevakali vakimvembela na kukilivicha. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yesu avasedukie, akalongile, “Nyenye vadala va Yelusalemu! Mbihile kunivembela nene, ila mwivembele nyenye na vana venu. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Kwa kuva figono fikwacha pevilonga, ‘Vafunyilwe vala vadala yesevibaba vala kukong'echa vana!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Chipindi icho, vanu davavanga kufilongela fidunda, ‘Tugwilie na kidunda kadodo!’ ‘Tugubike!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Kwa mana, ngita vanu vakuugitila libiki lidodi ifi, daivecha wuli kwa libiki ligamu?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Vapuga vakavategule vahofu vavili, neke vadochwe pamwi na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Pevafikile pono pepikemelwa, “Libang'a,” Baho vakamvamba Yesu mukipindilihicho. Na vala vahofu vavili vakavambwa kila yumwi mukipindilihicho kyake, yumwi lubali lwa kuliya na yungi palubali lwa kusoto. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Yesu akalongile, “Daada uvalekela sambi kwakuva sevichela kyevigita.” Baho vakagavine myenda gyake kwa gudugudu. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Vanu vakali vemile bahala vakilola. Navo vakomi va Vayawudi vakali vakumbeda akilonga, “Avakombuwe vanu vangi, leke ikombowe yumwene ngita mwene ndi Kilisito, Mkombosi yeahaguliwe na Nguluvi!”<verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Vapuga navo vakamligile vakamuhelelie na kumgavila difwayi njachu. <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />Valongile, “Ngita veve ndakyene ndi Ng'achale va Vayawudi, wuyiwokole yumwene.”<verse eid="LUK 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Filafila vakavikile kibawo kukyanya lya kipindilihicho kyake kyekisimbilwe njowo ichi, “Uyu ndi Ng'achale va Vayawudi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Muwofu yumwi pagati lya vala vevavambilwe, akamligile Yesu, “Wuli, veve se ndi Kilisito mkombosi? Ifyo wikombole yuve na utukombole na nefwe.”<verse eid="LUK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Ila yula muwofu yungi akamlakila mweyage akilonga, “Wuli, veve seukumwogofya Nguluvi? Veve uhigilwe ngita mwene. <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Nene na veve tuhigilwe unofu, ifyo tuwanuka mahombo galagala gye tukagagitile. Ila munu uyu seagitile kyokyonda kiwofu.” <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Baho akalongie, “Vee Yesu undiwike na nene pewikwingila pa Ung'achale vako.”<verse eid="LUK 23:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yesu akamuhiga, “Ndakyene ndikulongela, neng'uli wivecha na nene kumafunde.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ifuwa mukipindilihicho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayo 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maliko 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-36">Yohani 19.28-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Yikali ngita saa sita pamunyi, kukali na kisi pa inyi lyonda mbaka saa tisa, <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />pasiya lyelikali ligawanike pono pavili mukaye lya Nguluvi lyademwike fipande fivili kuhuma pakyanya mbaka panyi. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Yesu akavemba kwa lichwi likomi, “Daada mumawoko gyako ndivika numbula lyangu.” Peamalile kulonga ago, akafuwe.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Yula mkomi va vapuga va lipinga mia Vakilumi pealolile gegahumie akamnjuma Nguluvi akalonga, “Ndakyene uyu akali munu msanzi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Vanu vala vonda vevakali vehele kulola njowo chila, pevalolila gala gegahumie, vawuyile mukaye lyawo kuno vakwitova mkihafu kwa kusugwima. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Ila vanu vonda vevamchelie Yesu pamwi na vala vadala yevalongochile pamwi nave kuhuma ku Galilaya, vemile patali vakilola njowo chila.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ivikwa muugono</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matayo 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maliko 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohani 19.38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Suwe, kukali na munu yumwi mnofu litawa lyake Yusufu, mwene kaye va mwani va Vayawudi kyekikemelwa Alimataya akali munu msanzi yeaginyilwe.<verse eid="LUK 23:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />Akali ichindila kwacha kwa ung'achale va Nguluvi. Ata ngita akali ihuma muinyi lya Alimataya yumwi va vakomi mulidamo lya Vayawudi, seidikile gala gyevavagite vayage. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Suwe, munu yula ahelelie kwa Pilato, akasukile agavilwe muvili gya Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Akwisile muvili va Yesu kuhuma pa lipindilihicho na akauchungutilie ligubiko, akauvika muugono lyelikali lihogulwe muliganga nalyo likali lave kumvika munu. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Kigono ikyo ikali ijumaa, kigono kya kuandalisa kigono kya kutulula.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Vala vadala yevalongue na Yesu kuhuma pa Galilaya vevamfwatile Yusufu, na vakaliwene lila muugono na muvili vake Yesu peuvikilwe. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Baho vawuyila pakaye, vakatayalisile manung'ililo gya kuubaka mvili gwa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:56">Kigono kya kutulula vatulile ngita malagicho gya Musa gegalagichwe.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Kuchulubuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Matayo 28.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maliko 16.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohani 20.1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Kigono kya jumapili nyolasagala, vala vadala vahelelie muugono kuno vategue gala manung'ililo gevaandalise. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Vakaliwene lila liganga lyelikali ligubikile muugono libingiliswe patali na ligono. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Pevingie mugati, sevauwonile muvili va Mtwa Yesu.<figure style="fig" file="16 Tomb.jpg" size="col" ref="24.3">Liganga lyelibilingiswe</figure> <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Pevakali wave viduduva luchowo lula, bahobaho vanu vavili vevafwalile myenda gyeging'alile pee, vakaimile pepi navo. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Avo vadala vakawogwipe hilo, vakagundime mumhanga. Baho, vanu vala vakavalongie, “Wuli, mukumusaka yeagehe wumi pagati lya vanu vevafuwe? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Kwahela baha, achulubuke. Muwike geavalongie peakali ukoya Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />‘Mwana va Munu etakilwa ahechilwe na vanu venye sambi navo vakumuwamba mulipindilihicho na kigono kya udatu echulubuka.’”<verse eid="LUK 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Baho vala vadala vakawiwuke machowo gyeavalongie Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Pevawuyile kuhuma muugono, vakavalongie njowo cha Yesu vala vanjagila chumi na yumwi pamwi na vangi makani gyonda. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Vadala vevalongile njowo chila kwa vanjagila ndi Maliya Magidala, Yoana na Malia maye va Yakobo, pamwi na vadala vangi vevalongochine pamwi. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Vanjagila va Yesu vawonile njowo chechilongilwe na vala vadala ndi upufi hela, ifyo sevidikile. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Ila Peteli ahegile na kunyila mbaka muugono. Peagundamile kung'omelela mugati, akawene ligubiko hela. Baho awuyile pakaye kuno adudwive kwa gala gegahumie.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lugendo kuhelela ku Emau</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Maliko 16.12-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Kigono kilakila, vachulila vavili va Yesu vakali vihelela pa kijiji kimwi kyekikemelwa Emau, utali va kilometa chumi na yimwi kuhuma ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Vakali veywanga kwa gala gonda gegahumie. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Pevali mung'asi vakiywanga, Yesu yumwene akavahumie na akalongochine navo. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Vamwene kwa meho gawo ila sevakamuchelile. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Yesu akavahucha, “Mwiywanga liki kuno mwigenda?” Na vene vakaimile chii kuno vasugwime. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Yumwi vawo, yeakemelilwe Kileopa, amkamuhuchile, “Wuli, veve ndi mgenji wi weka pa mwani va Yelusalemu sewichela gegihumie ukoya figono ifi?”<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Yesu akavahucha, “Makani liki?” Vao vakamuhiga, “Makani gyegamuhumie Yesu va Nasaleti. Munu akali mvichi va Nguluvi munya umwimike va kugita na kuwulanicha makani pautalo lya Nguluvi na pautalo lya vanu vonda. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Vakomi va vatekechi na vatavala vetu vakamuhechile adochwe. Baho vakamvamba mukipindilihicho. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Ila nefwe tukachindile kuva mwene ndi ngaavakombola vanu va Isilaeli. Nondee neng'uli kigono kya udatu kuhuma pegahumie makani ago. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Vamonga va vadala kuhuma mu lipinga lyetu vagatugitile tuswituke. Nyolasagala vahelelie kuugono, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />ila sevakuvawene muvili vake. Vakawuyile vakatulongie vahumilwe na ndumindumi va Ngulivi vevavalongie kuva Yesu ndi mumi. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Vangi venu vahelelie muugono vakawene gala gavalongile vala vadala, ila sevamuwonile Yesu.” <verse eid="LUK 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Yesu akavalongie, “Wuli, muvapufi na numbula chenu ndi mikangafu kwidikila gonda gegalongilwe na vavichi va Nguluvi! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Wuli, seitakilwe Kilisito kugudwa kwa ng'asi ilyo na pambele kwingila muukomi vake?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Ndipo Yesu akavahumulile makani gyonda gyegasimbilwe gyegikumlonga mwene Mumasimbo gya Nguluvi kuvangila mukiganulo kya Musa mbaka vavichi va Nguluvi vonda.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Pevakali pepi na kijiji kyevali vihelela, Yesu agitile ngita echumbanicha na lugendo, <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />ila vawo vakambebelise hilo, “Wikale pamwi na nefwe, kwakuva nondee ndi palumie na kisi likwingila.” Suwe akaingie mugati kwikala navo. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Peikalile panyi na kulia kyakulia pamwi navo, akategue libumunda na akamufunyile Nguluvi akaudumula na akavagavila. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Bahobaho meho gawo gakadinduliwe, vakamuchela kuva mwene ndi Yesu, ila mwene akayaganile. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Suwe, vakahuchine, “Wuli, numbula chetu segikali na lukeduko ukoya petukali mung'asi peakali akutugumbutulila Masimbo gegasimbilwe mukiganulo kya Nguluvi?”<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Bahobaho vakahega na kuwuya ku Yelusalemu, ukoya vakavawene vala vachulila kumi na yumwi va Yesu na vanu vangi vevakali pamwi navo, <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />vakavalongie vachulila vala vavili, “Ndakyene Mtwa achulubuke, amuhumie Simoni.”<verse eid="LUK 24:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Baho avo vachulila vavili navo vakavalongie gala gyegivahumie mung'asi, na namuna pevamuchelile kwa kudumula libumunda.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvahumia vachulila vake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matayo 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maliko 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohani 20.19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Magito 1.6-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Pevali vakivalongela ago, Yesu yumwene akaemile pagati lyawo, akavongie, “Ulutengamaso iveche na nyenye.” <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Vakatinuke na kwogofya vakahochile vawene ligelawima. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Ila Yesu akavahucha, “Wuli, mwikogopa? Wuli, semwidikila mu numbula chenu? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Mulole mawoko na magulu gyangu lya kuva ndi nene. Munikolele mulole, kwa kuva ligelawima lihela muvili na michege ngita pemkunilola.”<verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Pealongile ago, avawonise mawoko na magulu gyake. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Vakali sevidikila, kuno vakidudwiva, mbaka ikavagitile vahoche labuda sendakyene, ifyo Yesu akavahucha, “Mgehe na kyakulia kyokyonda baha?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Vakamgavie kipande kya somba yeabanikilwe. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Akakitegule akalie, vonda vakimulola.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Baho akavalongie, “Aga ndi mana lya machowo gyangu chendivalongilige pendikala pamwi na nyenye. Kuva ikali lasima gagitilwe gala gyonda gyegasimbilwe mukiganulo kya malagicho gya Musa na pa figanulo fya vavichi na pa kiganulo kya Sabuli.”<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Baho Yesu akachilangachile luhala vawo neke vaveche kugachela Masimbo gya Nguluvi. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Akavalongie, “Aga ndigo gayandikilwe, kuva Kilisito eguda na kigono kya udatu echulubuka. <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />Kangi kwa umwimike va litawa lya Yesu vanu va inyi chonda kuvangila Yelusalemu davidalikiwa kuva vahechele sambi chawo,. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Nyenye mulolile makani ago na muvalongele vanu vangi. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Nene dandikumlagicha kwa nyenye muhe va Nguluvi ambaye Daada akavalongie dakuvagavila, ila nyenye muchindile ku mwani mbaka pemwikwanuka yila ludali yeihuma kukyanya.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ewuya kuluhano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:19-20">Matayo 16.19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Magito 1.9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Pambele Yesu akavalongoche vachulila vake kwelela kwivala lya mwani mbaka ku Betania, ukoya akainamula mawoko gyake kukyanya, akavagavila lufunyo. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Peakali akuvagavila lufunyo, akavaleka, akanyamuliwe kuhelele kuluhano. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Vavo vakamfunyile na vakawuyile ku Yelusalemu kuno vikeduka. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Vakaendelie kwikala mukaye lya Nguluvi na kumfunya Nguluvi.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>